window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a440-c48d8240abb2b753.json"]={sha256:"c48d8240abb2b753dbd096b8ef9e0770a47a4bdb6a0158aecc46c2e52ecf69f6",value:{"id":"a440","title":"白光干涉表面輪廓儀","titleEn":"White-light interferometric profilometers","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以相干掃描干涉術（CSI）為核心，理解寬頻光源為何只在零光程差附近產生條紋、包絡與相位如何合成次奈米高度，再把干涉物鏡的數值孔徑、壓電掃描器、相機雜訊、蝙蝠翼邊緣誤差與異材相位差整合成可依 ISO 25178-600 校正與交付的表面輪廓量測工程。","summaryEn":"Built around coherence scanning interferometry (CSI), understand why a broadband source produces fringes only near zero optical-path difference and how envelope and phase combine into sub-nanometre height, then integrate objective numerical aperture, the piezo scanner, camera noise, batwing edge artefacts and dissimilar-material phase offsets into surface-topography metrology that can be calibrated and delivered per ISO 25178-600.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-precision-metrology","subcategoryTitle":"光頻標準、慣性感測與干涉量測","subcategoryTitleEn":"Optical frequency standards, inertial sensing and interferometric metrology","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-precision-metrology","learningTags":["optics","optics-precision-metrology","interferometer"],"architectureFamily":"interferometer","architectureNodes":[["寬頻 LED 光源與 Köhler 照明","Broadband LED source and Köhler illumination"],["Mirau 干涉物鏡與參考鏡","Mirau interference objective and reference mirror"],["壓電垂直掃描器","Piezo vertical scanner"],["相機與相干圖擷取","Camera and correlogram acquisition"],["包絡／相位高度演算法","Envelope/phase height algorithm"],["校正標準片與不確定度報告","Calibration standards and uncertainty report"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[2,1],[1,3],[3,4],[5,4]],"diagram":{"type":"interferometer","labels":["寬頻 LED 光源與 Köhler 照明","Mirau 干涉物鏡與參考鏡","壓電垂直掃描器","相機與相干圖擷取","包絡／相位高度演算法"],"labelsEn":["Broadband LED source and Köhler illumination","Mirau interference objective and reference mirror","Piezo vertical scanner","Camera and correlogram acquisition","Envelope/phase height algorithm"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"MEMS 台階量測練習：以 50× Mirau 物鏡（NA 0.55）、λ₀ = 570 nm、Δλ = 100 nm 量一個標稱 2.5 µm 的矽台階。相干長度 l_c = 570²/100 ≈ 3.25 µm，包絡高度寬度 ≈ 1.6 µm，台階 2.5 µm 大於 1.6 µm，所以上下兩面包絡分離、不會有蝙蝠翼。掃描範圍 20 µm、步距 λ₀/8 = 71 nm → 281 幀，100 幀/秒需 2.8 s。橫向解析度 0.61×570/0.55 ≈ 0.63 µm，視場 133 µm。光子雜訊：N = 10⁴、V = 0.5 → 單幀 0.9 nm，包絡內 40 幀平均 ≈ 0.14 nm。不確定度：放大係數 0.2%×2.5 µm = 5 nm、參考面殘餘 2 nm、標準片證書 2 nm、雜訊 0.14 nm、取樣區 1 nm，RSS ≈ 5.8 nm，k = 2 ≈ 12 nm，相對 0.5%。若改用 10× 物鏡，橫向解析度退到 1.16 µm，台階邊緣的過渡區加寬，但高度不確定度幾乎不變。數值為教學假設，不代表任何儀器規格。","textEn":"MEMS step exercise: measure a nominal 2.5 µm silicon step with a 50× Mirau objective (NA 0.55), λ₀ = 570 nm, Δλ = 100 nm. Coherence length l_c = 570²/100 ≈ 3.25 µm, envelope height width ≈ 1.6 µm; the 2.5 µm step exceeds 1.6 µm, so the upper and lower envelopes separate and no batwings occur. Scan range 20 µm at a step of λ₀/8 = 71 nm → 281 frames, 2.8 s at 100 frames per second. Lateral resolution 0.61×570/0.55 ≈ 0.63 µm, field 133 µm. Photon noise: N = 10⁴, V = 0.5 → 0.9 nm per frame, ≈ 0.14 nm after averaging 40 frames inside the envelope. Uncertainty: amplification 0.2%×2.5 µm = 5 nm, reference residual 2 nm, standard certificate 2 nm, noise 0.14 nm, sampling region 1 nm, RSS ≈ 5.8 nm, k = 2 ≈ 12 nm, relative 0.5%. Switching to a 10× objective degrades lateral resolution to 1.16 µm and widens the edge transition but leaves the height uncertainty almost unchanged. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a440-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「低相干干涉與相干長度」與「相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Low-coherence interference and coherence length\" and \"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a440-v12-01","title":"低相干干涉與相干長度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and coherence length: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「寬頻光源與零光程差包絡」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Broadband source and zero-OPD envelope” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"白光干涉輪廓儀用 LED 或鹵素燈這類頻寬上百奈米的光源照明一個干涉物鏡，物鏡內部的分光膜把光分到待測表面與內建參考鏡。因為每個波長的條紋週期不同，只有在兩臂光程差接近零的位置各波長的條紋才同相疊加，離開零光程差幾個條紋後就互相抵消；於是條紋被一個寬度約等於相干長度的包絡包住，包絡的位置直接標記表面高度，沒有單色干涉儀每 λ/2 的相位模糊。整個表面高度圖由物鏡沿光軸掃描、每個像素各自找出包絡位置而得。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「寬頻光源與零光程差包絡」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A white-light profilometer illuminates an interference objective with an LED or halogen source of bandwidth above one hundred nanometres; a beamsplitter film inside the objective divides light between the test surface and a built-in reference mirror. Because every wavelength has a different fringe period, fringes of all wavelengths add in phase only where the two arms' optical paths nearly match and cancel a few fringes away; the fringes are therefore wrapped in an envelope about one coherence length wide whose position marks the surface height directly, with none of the λ/2 phase ambiguity of a monochromatic interferometer. A height map results from scanning the objective along its axis and locating the envelope independently in every pixel. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Broadband source and zero-OPD envelope”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：相干長度 l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Coherence length l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ.","failure":"常見誤解：「白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「寬頻光源與零光程差包絡」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Broadband source and zero-OPD envelope”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-01-k1","title":"低相干干涉與相干長度","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and coherence length","text":"白光干涉輪廓儀用 LED 或鹵素燈這類頻寬上百奈米的光源照明一個干涉物鏡，物鏡內部的分光膜把光分到待測表面與內建參考鏡。因為每個波長的條紋週期不同，只有在兩臂光程差接近零的位置各波長的條紋才同相疊加，離開零光程差幾個條紋後就互相抵消；於是條紋被一個寬度約等於相干長度的包絡包住，包絡的位置直接標記表面高度，沒有單色干涉儀每 λ/2 的相位模糊。","textEn":"A white-light profilometer illuminates an interference objective with an LED or halogen source of bandwidth above one hundred nanometres; a beamsplitter film inside the objective divides light between the test surface and a built-in reference mirror. Because every wavelength has a different fringe period, fringes of all wavelengths add in phase only where the two arms' optical paths nearly match and cancel a few fringes away; the fringes are therefore wrapped in an envelope about one coherence length wide whose position marks the surface height directly, with none of the λ/2 phase ambiguity of a monochromatic interferometer.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低相干干涉與相干長度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Low-coherence interference and coherence length\" is correct?","options":["白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。","白光干涉輪廓儀用 LED 或鹵素燈這類頻寬上百奈米的光源照明一個干涉物鏡，物鏡內部的分光膜把光分到待測表面與內建參考鏡。","掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。"],"optionsEn":["A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.","A white-light profilometer illuminates an interference objective with an LED or halogen source of bandwidth above one hundred nanometres.","Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used."],"answer":1,"explanation":"白光干涉輪廓儀用 LED 或鹵素燈這類頻寬上百奈米的光源照明一個干涉物鏡，物鏡內部的分光膜把光分到待測表面與內建參考鏡。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A white-light profilometer illuminates an interference objective with an LED or halogen source of bandwidth above one hundred nanometres; a beamsplitter film inside the objective divides light between the test surface and a built-in reference mirror. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a440-v12-02","title":"低相干干涉與相干長度：定量估算","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and coherence length: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「寬頻光源與零光程差包絡」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Broadband source and zero-OPD envelope” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：相干長度 l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ。教學假設中心波長 λ₀ = 570 nm、頻寬 Δλ = 100 nm：l_c ≈ 570²/100 ≈ 3.25 µm。因為表面高度變化 z 造成光程差 2z，包絡在高度座標上的寬度約 l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm，其中包含約 1.6/0.285 ≈ 6 個條紋，條紋在高度上的週期為 λ₀/2 = 285 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Coherence length l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ. Teaching assumptions: centre wavelength λ₀ = 570 nm and bandwidth Δλ = 100 nm give l_c ≈ 570²/100 ≈ 3.25 µm. Since a surface height change z creates an optical-path difference of 2z, the envelope width in height coordinates is about l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm, containing about 1.6/0.285 ≈ 6 fringes with a height period of λ₀/2 = 285 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在拋光矽片上記錄單一像素隨掃描位置的強度曲線（相干圖），量出包絡的半高寬與條紋週期，與由光源光譜儀量到的 λ₀、Δλ 計算值比較；更換窄頻濾光片使 Δλ 減半，確認包絡寬度大約加倍而條紋週期幾乎不變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: On a polished silicon wafer record one pixel's intensity against scan position (the correlogram), measure the envelope's full width at half maximum and the fringe period, and compare with values computed from λ₀ and Δλ measured by a spectrometer on the source; insert a narrower bandpass filter that halves Δλ and confirm the envelope roughly doubles in width while the fringe period barely changes.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"相干長度 l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ。教學假設中心波長 λ₀ = 570 nm、頻寬 Δλ = 100 nm：l_c ≈ 570²/100 ≈ 3.25 µm。因為表面高度變化 z 造成光程差 2z，包絡在高度座標上的寬度約 l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm，其中包含約 1.6/0.285 ≈ 6 個條紋，條紋在高度上的週期為 λ₀/2 = 285 nm。","textEn":"Coherence length l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ. Teaching assumptions: centre wavelength λ₀ = 570 nm and bandwidth Δλ = 100 nm give l_c ≈ 570²/100 ≈ 3.25 µm. Since a surface height change z creates an optical-path difference of 2z, the envelope width in height coordinates is about l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm, containing about 1.6/0.285 ≈ 6 fringes with a height period of λ₀/2 = 285 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低相干干涉與相干長度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Low-coherence interference and coherence length\", which statement holds?","options":["參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。","光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。","相干長度 l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ。"],"optionsEn":["Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted.","An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings.","Coherence length l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ."],"answer":2,"explanation":"相干長度 l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Coherence length l_c ≈ λ₀²/Δλ. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a440-v12-03","title":"低相干干涉與相干長度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and coherence length: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「寬頻光源與零光程差包絡」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Broadband source and zero-OPD envelope” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在拋光矽片上記錄單一像素隨掃描位置的強度曲線（相干圖），量出包絡的半高寬與條紋週期，與由光源光譜儀量到的 λ₀、Δλ 計算值比較；更換窄頻濾光片使 Δλ 減半，確認包絡寬度大約加倍而條紋週期幾乎不變。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"On a polished silicon wafer record one pixel's intensity against scan position (the correlogram), measure the envelope's full width at half maximum and the fringe period, and compare with values computed from λ₀ and Δλ measured by a spectrometer on the source; insert a narrower bandpass filter that halves Δλ and confirm the envelope roughly doubles in width while the fringe period barely changes. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：光源老化或濾光片偏移使光譜變窄，相干長度拉長到十幾微米，包絡變平、峰值定位變差，而且相鄰高度差小於包絡寬度的結構開始互相干擾，粗糙度讀值無故升高。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Source ageing or a shifted filter narrows the spectrum, stretches the coherence length to over ten micrometres, flattens the envelope and degrades peak location, while neighbouring structures whose height difference is below the envelope width start to interfere with each other and roughness readings rise without cause.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在拋光矽片上記錄單一像素隨掃描位置的強度曲線（相干圖），量出包絡的半高寬與條紋週期，與由光源光譜儀量到的 λ₀、Δλ 計算值比較；更換窄頻濾光片使 Δλ 減半，確認包絡寬度大約加倍而條紋週期幾乎不變。","textEn":"On a polished silicon wafer record one pixel's intensity against scan position (the correlogram), measure the envelope's full width at half maximum and the fringe period, and compare with values computed from λ₀ and Δλ measured by a spectrometer on the source; insert a narrower bandpass filter that halves Δλ and confirm the envelope roughly doubles in width while the fringe period barely changes.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低相干干涉與相干長度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Low-coherence interference and coherence length\"?","options":["在拋光矽片上記錄單一像素隨掃描位置的強度曲線（相干圖），量出包絡的半高寬與條紋週期，與由光源光譜儀量到的 λ₀、Δλ 計算值比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。"],"optionsEn":["On a polished silicon wafer record one pixel's intensity against scan position (the correlogram), measure the envelope's full width at half maximum and the fringe period, and compare with values computed from λ₀ and Δλ measured by a spectrometer on the source.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在拋光矽片上記錄單一像素隨掃描位置的強度曲線（相干圖），量出包絡的半高寬與條紋週期，與由光源光譜儀量到的 λ₀、Δλ 計算值比較；更換窄頻濾光片使 Δλ 減半，確認包絡寬度大約加倍而條紋週期幾乎不變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"On a polished silicon wafer record one pixel's intensity against scan position (the correlogram), measure the envelope's full width at half maximum and the fringe period, and compare with values computed from λ₀ and Δλ measured by a spectrometer on the source; insert a narrower bandpass filter that halves Δλ and confirm the envelope roughly doubles in width while the fringe period barely changes. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a440-v12-04","title":"低相干干涉與相干長度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and coherence length: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「寬頻光源與零光程差包絡」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Broadband source and zero-OPD envelope” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"光源老化或濾光片偏移使光譜變窄，相干長度拉長到十幾微米，包絡變平、峰值定位變差，而且相鄰高度差小於包絡寬度的結構開始互相干擾，粗糙度讀值無故升高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Source ageing or a shifted filter narrows the spectrum, stretches the coherence length to over ten micrometres, flattens the envelope and degrades peak location, while neighbouring structures whose height difference is below the envelope width start to interfere with each other and roughness readings rise without cause. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：整個表面高度圖由物鏡沿光軸掃描、每個像素各自找出包絡位置而得。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A height map results from scanning the objective along its axis and locating the envelope independently in every pixel.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"光源老化或濾光片偏移使光譜變窄，相干長度拉長到十幾微米，包絡變平、峰值定位變差，而且相鄰高度差小於包絡寬度的結構開始互相干擾，粗糙度讀值無故升高。","textEn":"Source ageing or a shifted filter narrows the spectrum, stretches the coherence length to over ten micrometres, flattens the envelope and degrades peak location, while neighbouring structures whose height difference is below the envelope width start to interfere with each other and roughness readings rise without cause.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低相干干涉與相干長度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Low-coherence interference and coherence length\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","光源老化或濾光片偏移使光譜變窄，相干長度拉長到十幾微米，包絡變平、峰值定位變差，而且相鄰高度差小於包絡寬度的結構開始互相干擾，粗糙度讀值無故升高。","掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Source ageing or a shifted filter narrows the spectrum, stretches the coherence length to over ten micrometres, flattens the envelope and degrades peak location, while neighbouring structures whose height difference is below the envelope width start to interfere with each other and roughness readings rise without cause.","Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光源老化或濾光片偏移使光譜變窄，相干長度拉長到十幾微米，包絡變平、峰值定位變差，而且相鄰高度差小於包絡寬度的結構開始互相干擾，粗糙度讀值無故升高。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Source ageing or a shifted filter narrows the spectrum, stretches the coherence length to over ten micrometres, flattens the envelope and degrades peak location, while neighbouring structures whose height difference is below the envelope width start to interfere with each other and roughness readings rise without cause. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a440-v12-05","title":"相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「相干圖訊號與頻域分析」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Correlogram signal and frequency-domain analysis” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每個像素的相干圖可寫成 I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)]，g 是包絡、h 是表面高度、φ 是反射相位。只用包絡峰值定高度，重複性約在幾奈米；再利用包絡內條紋的相位可把高度精修到次奈米，但必須用包絡解開 λ/2 的整數模糊。頻域分析法對相干圖做傅立葉轉換，相位對波數的斜率給出高度（群速度等效），截距給出相位高度，兩者互相校驗。掃描取樣必須每個條紋至少四個點，否則相位會混疊。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「相干圖訊號與頻域分析」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each pixel's correlogram is I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)], with g the envelope, h the surface height and φ the reflection phase. Locating the envelope peak alone gives height with a repeatability of a few nanometres; using the fringe phase inside the envelope refines it to sub-nanometre, but the envelope must resolve the λ/2 integer ambiguity. Frequency-domain analysis Fourier-transforms the correlogram: the slope of phase against wavenumber gives a group-velocity height and the intercept gives a phase height, and the two cross-check each other. Scan sampling needs at least four points per fringe or the phase aliases. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Correlogram signal and frequency-domain analysis”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：取樣步距 λ₀/8 = 71 nm（每條紋 4 點）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Sampling step λ₀/8 = 71 nm (4 points per fringe).","failure":"常見誤解：「掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「相干圖訊號與頻域分析」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Correlogram signal and frequency-domain analysis”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-05-k1","title":"相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成","titleEn":"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase","text":"每個像素的相干圖可寫成 I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)]，g 是包絡、h 是表面高度、φ 是反射相位。只用包絡峰值定高度，重複性約在幾奈米；再利用包絡內條紋的相位可把高度精修到次奈米，但必須用包絡解開 λ/2 的整數模糊。","textEn":"Each pixel's correlogram is I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)], with g the envelope, h the surface height and φ the reflection phase. Locating the envelope peak alone gives height with a repeatability of a few nanometres; using the fringe phase inside the envelope refines it to sub-nanometre, but the envelope must resolve the λ/2 integer ambiguity.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase\" is correct?","options":["掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。","倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。","每個像素的相干圖可寫成 I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)]，g 是包絡、h 是表面高度、φ 是反射相位。"],"optionsEn":["Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used.","Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture.","Each pixel's correlogram is I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)], with g the envelope, h the surface height and φ the reflection phase."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每個像素的相干圖可寫成 I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)]，g 是包絡、h 是表面高度、φ 是反射相位。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each pixel's correlogram is I(z) = I₀[1 + V·g(z − h)·cos(4π(z − h)/λ₀ + φ)], with g the envelope, h the surface height and φ the reflection phase. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a440-v12-06","title":"相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成：定量估算","titleEn":"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「相干圖訊號與頻域分析」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Correlogram signal and frequency-domain analysis” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：取樣步距 λ₀/8 = 71 nm（每條紋 4 點）。相機 100 幀/秒時掃描速度 7.1 µm/s，掃 100 µm 需 14 s，掃 20 µm 只需 2.8 s（281 幀）。相位高度解析度受光子雜訊限制：像素滿井 N = 10⁴ 電子、條紋對比 V = 0.5 時單幀相位誤差 δφ ≈ 1/(V√N) = 0.02 rad，對應高度 δh = δφ·λ₀/(4π) ≈ 0.9 nm；包絡內約 40 幀平均後 ≈ 0.14 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Sampling step λ₀/8 = 71 nm (4 points per fringe). At 100 frames per second the scan speed is 7.1 µm/s, a 100 µm scan takes 14 s and a 20 µm scan only 2.8 s (281 frames). Phase-height resolution is photon-noise limited: with a pixel full well of N = 10⁴ electrons and fringe contrast V = 0.5 the single-frame phase error is δφ ≈ 1/(V√N) = 0.02 rad, a height of δh = δφ·λ₀/(4π) ≈ 0.9 nm, and averaging the roughly 40 frames inside the envelope gives ≈ 0.14 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：同一位置連續量兩次拋光平面，把兩張高度圖相減後取 Sq 再除以 √2，得到儀器量測雜訊（ISO 25178-600 的 measurement noise），分別在只用包絡與包絡加相位兩種演算法下比較，相位法應低一個數量級；再故意把取樣步距放大到每條紋 2 點，觀察高度圖出現條紋狀混疊。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure a polished flat twice at the same spot, subtract the two height maps, take Sq and divide by √2 to obtain the instrument measurement noise of ISO 25178-600; compare envelope-only and envelope-plus-phase algorithms, where the phase method should be an order of magnitude lower; then deliberately coarsen the step to 2 points per fringe and watch fringe-like aliasing appear in the height map.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"取樣步距 λ₀/8 = 71 nm（每條紋 4 點）。相機 100 幀/秒時掃描速度 7.1 µm/s，掃 100 µm 需 14 s，掃 20 µm 只需 2.8 s（281 幀）。相位高度解析度受光子雜訊限制：像素滿井 N = 10⁴ 電子、條紋對比 V = 0.5 時單幀相位誤差 δφ ≈ 1/(V√N) = 0.02 rad，對應高度 δh = δφ·λ₀/(4π) ≈ 0.9 nm；包絡內約 40 幀平均後 ≈ 0.14 nm。","textEn":"Sampling step λ₀/8 = 71 nm (4 points per fringe). At 100 frames per second the scan speed is 7.1 µm/s, a 100 µm scan takes 14 s and a 20 µm scan only 2.8 s (281 frames). Phase-height resolution is photon-noise limited: with a pixel full well of N = 10⁴ electrons and fringe contrast V = 0.5 the single-frame phase error is δφ ≈ 1/(V√N) = 0.02 rad, a height of δh = δφ·λ₀/(4π) ≈ 0.9 nm, and averaging the roughly 40 frames inside the envelope gives ≈ 0.14 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase\", which statement holds?","options":["取樣步距 λ₀/8 = 71 nm（每條紋 4 點）。","儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。","拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。"],"optionsEn":["Sampling step λ₀/8 = 71 nm (4 points per fringe).","Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid.","Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data."],"answer":0,"explanation":"取樣步距 λ₀/8 = 71 nm（每條紋 4 點）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Sampling step λ₀/8 = 71 nm (4 points per fringe). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a440-v12-07","title":"相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「相干圖訊號與頻域分析」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Correlogram signal and frequency-domain analysis” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"同一位置連續量兩次拋光平面，把兩張高度圖相減後取 Sq 再除以 √2，得到儀器量測雜訊（ISO 25178-600 的 measurement noise），分別在只用包絡與包絡加相位兩種演算法下比較，相位法應低一個數量級；再故意把取樣步距放大到每條紋 2 點，觀察高度圖出現條紋狀混疊。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure a polished flat twice at the same spot, subtract the two height maps, take Sq and divide by √2 to obtain the instrument measurement noise of ISO 25178-600; compare envelope-only and envelope-plus-phase algorithms, where the phase method should be an order of magnitude lower; then deliberately coarsen the step to 2 points per fringe and watch fringe-like aliasing appear in the height map. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：表面局部反射率太低或太高使條紋對比 V 降到 0.1，相位誤差放大五倍，演算法在解 λ/2 模糊時選錯整數，高度圖出現 285 nm 的孤立尖峰，被誤當成顆粒。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Where local reflectance is too low or too high the fringe contrast V drops to 0.1, phase error grows fivefold, the algorithm picks the wrong integer when resolving the λ/2 ambiguity and the height map shows isolated 285 nm spikes that are mistaken for particles.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同一位置連續量兩次拋光平面，把兩張高度圖相減後取 Sq 再除以 √2，得到儀器量測雜訊（ISO 25178-600 的 measurement noise），分別在只用包絡與包絡加相位兩種演算法下比較，相位法應低一個數量級；再故意把取樣步距放大到每條紋 2 點，觀察高度圖出現條紋狀混疊。","textEn":"Measure a polished flat twice at the same spot, subtract the two height maps, take Sq and divide by √2 to obtain the instrument measurement noise of ISO 25178-600; compare envelope-only and envelope-plus-phase algorithms, where the phase method should be an order of magnitude lower; then deliberately coarsen the step to 2 points per fringe and watch fringe-like aliasing appear in the height map.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","同一位置連續量兩次拋光平面，把兩張高度圖相減後取 Sq 再除以 √2，得到儀器量測雜訊（ISO 25178-600 的 measurement noise），分別在只用包絡與包絡加相位兩種演算法下比較，相位法應低一個數量級。","白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure a polished flat twice at the same spot, subtract the two height maps, take Sq and divide by √2 to obtain the instrument measurement noise of ISO 25178-600.","White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"同一位置連續量兩次拋光平面，把兩張高度圖相減後取 Sq 再除以 √2，得到儀器量測雜訊（ISO 25178-600 的 measurement noise），分別在只用包絡與包絡加相位兩種演算法下比較，相位法應低一個數量級；再故意把取樣步距放大到每條紋 2 點，觀察高度圖出現條紋狀混疊。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure a polished flat twice at the same spot, subtract the two height maps, take Sq and divide by √2 to obtain the instrument measurement noise of ISO 25178-600; compare envelope-only and envelope-plus-phase algorithms, where the phase method should be an order of magnitude lower; then deliberately coarsen the step to 2 points per fringe and watch fringe-like aliasing appear in the height map. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a440-v12-08","title":"相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成：失效診斷","titleEn":"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「相干圖訊號與頻域分析」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Correlogram signal and frequency-domain analysis” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"表面局部反射率太低或太高使條紋對比 V 降到 0.1，相位誤差放大五倍，演算法在解 λ/2 模糊時選錯整數，高度圖出現 285 nm 的孤立尖峰，被誤當成顆粒。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Where local reflectance is too low or too high the fringe contrast V drops to 0.1, phase error grows fivefold, the algorithm picks the wrong integer when resolving the λ/2 ambiguity and the height map shows isolated 285 nm spikes that are mistaken for particles. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：掃描取樣必須每個條紋至少四個點，否則相位會混疊。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Scan sampling needs at least four points per fringe or the phase aliases.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"表面局部反射率太低或太高使條紋對比 V 降到 0.1，相位誤差放大五倍，演算法在解 λ/2 模糊時選錯整數，高度圖出現 285 nm 的孤立尖峰，被誤當成顆粒。","textEn":"Where local reflectance is too low or too high the fringe contrast V drops to 0.1, phase error grows fivefold, the algorithm picks the wrong integer when resolving the λ/2 ambiguity and the height map shows isolated 285 nm spikes that are mistaken for particles.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「相干圖模型、包絡與相位的合成」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Correlogram model and combining envelope with phase\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。","表面局部反射率太低或太高使條紋對比 V 降到 0.1，相位誤差放大五倍，演算法在解 λ/2 模糊時選錯整數，高度圖出現 285 nm 的孤立尖峰，被誤當成顆粒。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture.","Where local reflectance is too low or too high the fringe contrast V drops to 0.1, phase error grows fivefold, the algorithm picks the wrong integer when resolving the λ/2 ambiguity and the height map shows isolated 285 nm spikes that are mistaken for particles."],"answer":2,"explanation":"表面局部反射率太低或太高使條紋對比 V 降到 0.1，相位誤差放大五倍，演算法在解 λ/2 模糊時選錯整數，高度圖出現 285 nm 的孤立尖峰，被誤當成顆粒。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Where local reflectance is too low or too high the fringe contrast V drops to 0.1, phase error grows fivefold, the algorithm picks the wrong integer when resolving the λ/2 ambiguity and the height map shows isolated 285 nm spikes that are mistaken for particles. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a440-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限」與「垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit\" and \"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a440-v12-09","title":"干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「Mirau 干涉物鏡與數值孔徑」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Mirau interference objective and numerical aperture” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"干涉物鏡有三種構型：Michelson 型在物鏡前方放分光立方體與側向參考鏡，只適合低倍率；Mirau 型把半透膜與一個小參考鏡疊在物鏡前方的玻璃板上，結構緊湊，覆蓋 10× 到 100×；Linnik 型用兩支相同物鏡分別對著樣品與參考鏡，可達最高數值孔徑但對準困難。橫向解析度由數值孔徑決定，可量測的最大表面斜率也由數值孔徑決定，因為鏡面反射光必須回到物鏡孔徑內；粗糙表面靠散射可略超過此限。Mirau 的參考鏡會遮住光瞳中心，使有效數值孔徑略小於標示值，並使高數值孔徑下的等效波長變長。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Mirau 干涉物鏡與數值孔徑」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Interference objectives come in three forms: Michelson puts a beamsplitter cube and side reference mirror ahead of the objective and suits only low magnification; Mirau stacks a semi-reflective film and a small reference mirror on a glass plate in front of the objective, compact and covering 10× to 100×; Linnik uses two matched objectives for sample and reference, reaching the highest numerical aperture but hard to align. Lateral resolution is set by numerical aperture, and so is the maximum measurable slope, because specularly reflected light must return inside the objective's aperture; rough surfaces exceed this slightly through scatter. The Mirau reference mirror obscures the pupil centre, making the effective numerical aperture a little below the nominal value and lengthening the equivalent wavelength at high aperture. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Mirau interference objective and numerical aperture”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：橫向解析度 ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA，斜率極限 ≈ arcsin(NA)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Lateral resolution ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA and slope limit ≈ arcsin(NA).","failure":"常見誤解：「倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Mirau 干涉物鏡與數值孔徑」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Mirau interference objective and numerical aperture”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-09-k1","title":"干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限","titleEn":"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit","text":"干涉物鏡有三種構型：Michelson 型在物鏡前方放分光立方體與側向參考鏡，只適合低倍率；Mirau 型把半透膜與一個小參考鏡疊在物鏡前方的玻璃板上，結構緊湊，覆蓋 10× 到 100×；Linnik 型用兩支相同物鏡分別對著樣品與參考鏡，可達最高數值孔徑但對準困難。橫向解析度由數值孔徑決定，可量測的最大表面斜率也由數值孔徑決定，因為鏡面反射光必須回到物鏡孔徑內；粗糙表面靠散射可略超過此限。","textEn":"Interference objectives come in three forms: Michelson puts a beamsplitter cube and side reference mirror ahead of the objective and suits only low magnification; Mirau stacks a semi-reflective film and a small reference mirror on a glass plate in front of the objective, compact and covering 10× to 100×; Linnik uses two matched objectives for sample and reference, reaching the highest numerical aperture but hard to align. Lateral resolution is set by numerical aperture, and so is the maximum measurable slope, because specularly reflected light must return inside the objective's aperture; rough surfaces exceed this slightly through scatter.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit\" is correct?","options":["干涉物鏡有三種構型：Michelson 型在物鏡前方放分光立方體與側向參考鏡，只適合低倍率。","倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。","參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。"],"optionsEn":["Interference objectives come in three forms: Michelson puts a beamsplitter cube and side reference mirror ahead of the objective and suits only low magnification.","Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture.","Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted."],"answer":0,"explanation":"干涉物鏡有三種構型：Michelson 型在物鏡前方放分光立方體與側向參考鏡，只適合低倍率；Mirau 型把半透膜與一個小參考鏡疊在物鏡前方的玻璃板上，結構緊湊，覆蓋 10× 到 100×；Linnik 型用兩支相同物鏡分別對著樣品與參考鏡，可達最高數值孔徑但對準困難。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Interference objectives come in three forms: Michelson puts a beamsplitter cube and side reference mirror ahead of the objective and suits only low magnification; Mirau stacks a semi-reflective film and a small reference mirror on a glass plate in front of the objective, compact and covering 10× to 100×; Linnik uses two matched objectives for sample and reference, reaching the highest numerical aperture but hard to align. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a440-v12-10","title":"干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限：定量估算","titleEn":"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Mirau 干涉物鏡與數值孔徑」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Mirau interference objective and numerical aperture” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：橫向解析度 ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA，斜率極限 ≈ arcsin(NA)。λ₀ = 570 nm 時：50× NA 0.55 → 0.63 µm、33°；10× NA 0.30 → 1.16 µm、17.5°；5× NA 0.13 → 2.7 µm、7.5°；100× NA 0.85 → 0.41 µm、58°。相機像素 6.5 µm 在 50× 下對應 0.13 µm/像素，1024 像素視場 133 µm，Nyquist 取樣 0.26 µm 小於 0.63 µm 的光學解析度，符合取樣要求。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Lateral resolution ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA and slope limit ≈ arcsin(NA). At λ₀ = 570 nm: 50× NA 0.55 → 0.63 µm and 33°; 10× NA 0.30 → 1.16 µm and 17.5°; 5× NA 0.13 → 2.7 µm and 7.5°; 100× NA 0.85 → 0.41 µm and 58°. A 6.5 µm camera pixel at 50× maps to 0.13 µm per pixel, a 1024-pixel field of 133 µm, and the 0.26 µm Nyquist sampling is finer than the 0.63 µm optical resolution, satisfying the sampling requirement. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：量一片已知週期的解析度標準片（例如 1 µm 到 0.4 µm 的線對光柵），找出條紋對比降到可辨認門檻的最細週期，與 0.61λ₀/NA 比較；再量一顆已知半徑的拋光球，記錄高度圖中資料失效的邊緣位置，由幾何算出斜率並與 arcsin(NA) 比較，確認物鏡的有效數值孔徑。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure a resolution standard of known pitch (line gratings from 1 µm down to 0.4 µm), find the finest pitch at which fringe contrast still resolves and compare with 0.61λ₀/NA; then measure a polished sphere of known radius, note where the height map loses data at the edge, compute the slope from geometry and compare with arcsin(NA) to confirm the objective's effective numerical aperture.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"橫向解析度 ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA，斜率極限 ≈ arcsin(NA)。λ₀ = 570 nm 時：50× NA 0.55 → 0.63 µm、33°；10× NA 0.30 → 1.16 µm、17.5°；5× NA 0.13 → 2.7 µm、7.5°；100× NA 0.85 → 0.41 µm、58°。相機像素 6.5 µm 在 50× 下對應 0.13 µm/像素，1024 像素視場 133 µm，Nyquist 取樣 0.26 µm 小於 0.63 µm 的光學解析度，符合取樣要求。","textEn":"Lateral resolution ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA and slope limit ≈ arcsin(NA). At λ₀ = 570 nm: 50× NA 0.55 → 0.63 µm and 33°; 10× NA 0.30 → 1.16 µm and 17.5°; 5× NA 0.13 → 2.7 µm and 7.5°; 100× NA 0.85 → 0.41 µm and 58°. A 6.5 µm camera pixel at 50× maps to 0.13 µm per pixel, a 1024-pixel field of 133 µm, and the 0.26 µm Nyquist sampling is finer than the 0.63 µm optical resolution, satisfying the sampling requirement.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit\", which statement holds?","options":["光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。","橫向解析度 ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA，斜率極限 ≈ arcsin(NA)。","白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings.","Lateral resolution ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA and slope limit ≈ arcsin(NA).","White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"橫向解析度 ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA，斜率極限 ≈ arcsin(NA)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Lateral resolution ≈ 0.61λ₀/NA and slope limit ≈ arcsin(NA). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a440-v12-11","title":"干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Mirau 干涉物鏡與數值孔徑」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Mirau interference objective and numerical aperture” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"量一片已知週期的解析度標準片（例如 1 µm 到 0.4 µm 的線對光柵），找出條紋對比降到可辨認門檻的最細週期，與 0.61λ₀/NA 比較；再量一顆已知半徑的拋光球，記錄高度圖中資料失效的邊緣位置，由幾何算出斜率並與 arcsin(NA) 比較，確認物鏡的有效數值孔徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure a resolution standard of known pitch (line gratings from 1 µm down to 0.4 µm), find the finest pitch at which fringe contrast still resolves and compare with 0.61λ₀/NA; then measure a polished sphere of known radius, note where the height map loses data at the edge, compute the slope from geometry and compare with arcsin(NA) to confirm the objective's effective numerical aperture. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用 10× 物鏡量斜率 25° 的透鏡模具側壁，反射光完全落在孔徑外，高度圖出現整片無資料區，軟體以內插填補後給出平滑但虛構的輪廓，導致模具斜角被錯誤驗收。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Measuring a 25° lens-mould sidewall with a 10× objective puts the reflected light entirely outside the aperture, the height map shows a blank region, the software fills it by interpolation with a smooth but fictitious profile, and the mould draft angle is wrongly accepted.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量一片已知週期的解析度標準片（例如 1 µm 到 0.4 µm 的線對光柵），找出條紋對比降到可辨認門檻的最細週期，與 0.61λ₀/NA 比較；再量一顆已知半徑的拋光球，記錄高度圖中資料失效的邊緣位置，由幾何算出斜率並與 arcsin(NA) 比較，確認物鏡的有效數值孔徑。","textEn":"Measure a resolution standard of known pitch (line gratings from 1 µm down to 0.4 µm), find the finest pitch at which fringe contrast still resolves and compare with 0.61λ₀/NA; then measure a polished sphere of known radius, note where the height map loses data at the edge, compute the slope from geometry and compare with arcsin(NA) to confirm the objective's effective numerical aperture.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。","量一片已知週期的解析度標準片（例如 1 µm 到 0.4 µm 的線對光柵），找出條紋對比降到可辨認門檻的最細週期，與 0.61λ₀/NA 比較。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.","Measure a resolution standard of known pitch (line gratings from 1 µm down to 0.4 µm), find the finest pitch at which fringe contrast still resolves and compare with 0.61λ₀/NA."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量一片已知週期的解析度標準片（例如 1 µm 到 0.4 µm 的線對光柵），找出條紋對比降到可辨認門檻的最細週期，與 0.61λ₀/NA 比較；再量一顆已知半徑的拋光球，記錄高度圖中資料失效的邊緣位置，由幾何算出斜率並與 arcsin(NA) 比較，確認物鏡的有效數值孔徑。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure a resolution standard of known pitch (line gratings from 1 µm down to 0.4 µm), find the finest pitch at which fringe contrast still resolves and compare with 0.61λ₀/NA; then measure a polished sphere of known radius, note where the height map loses data at the edge, compute the slope from geometry and compare with arcsin(NA) to confirm the objective's effective numerical aperture. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a440-v12-12","title":"干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限：失效診斷","titleEn":"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Mirau 干涉物鏡與數值孔徑」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Mirau interference objective and numerical aperture” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用 10× 物鏡量斜率 25° 的透鏡模具側壁，反射光完全落在孔徑外，高度圖出現整片無資料區，軟體以內插填補後給出平滑但虛構的輪廓，導致模具斜角被錯誤驗收。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Measuring a 25° lens-mould sidewall with a 10× objective puts the reflected light entirely outside the aperture, the height map shows a blank region, the software fills it by interpolation with a smooth but fictitious profile, and the mould draft angle is wrongly accepted. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：Mirau 的參考鏡會遮住光瞳中心，使有效數值孔徑略小於標示值，並使高數值孔徑下的等效波長變長。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The Mirau reference mirror obscures the pupil centre, making the effective numerical aperture a little below the nominal value and lengthening the equivalent wavelength at high aperture.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用 10× 物鏡量斜率 25° 的透鏡模具側壁，反射光完全落在孔徑外，高度圖出現整片無資料區，軟體以內插填補後給出平滑但虛構的輪廓，導致模具斜角被錯誤驗收。","textEn":"Measuring a 25° lens-mould sidewall with a 10× objective puts the reflected light entirely outside the aperture, the height map shows a blank region, the software fills it by interpolation with a smooth but fictitious profile, and the mould draft angle is wrongly accepted.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「干涉物鏡、橫向解析度與斜率極限」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Interference objectives, lateral resolution and slope limit\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["用 10× 物鏡量斜率 25° 的透鏡模具側壁，反射光完全落在孔徑外，高度圖出現整片無資料區，軟體以內插填補後給出平滑但虛構的輪廓，導致模具斜角被錯誤驗收。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。"],"optionsEn":["Measuring a 25° lens-mould sidewall with a 10× objective puts the reflected light entirely outside the aperture, the height map shows a blank region, the software fills it by interpolation with a smooth but fictitious profile, and the mould draft angle is wrongly accepted.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用 10× 物鏡量斜率 25° 的透鏡模具側壁，反射光完全落在孔徑外，高度圖出現整片無資料區，軟體以內插填補後給出平滑但虛構的輪廓，導致模具斜角被錯誤驗收。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Measuring a 25° lens-mould sidewall with a 10× objective puts the reflected light entirely outside the aperture, the height map shows a blank region, the software fills it by interpolation with a smooth but fictitious profile, and the mould draft angle is wrongly accepted. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a440-v12-13","title":"垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「壓電掃描器、相機與參考鏡」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Piezo scanner, camera and reference mirror” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"垂直掃描由壓電致動器帶動物鏡或整個干涉頭，以電容感測器閉迴路線性化，行程從 100 µm 到 1 mm 以上，長行程機型改用馬達配光學尺。掃描器的線性度直接變成高度比例誤差，因此儀器要以步高標準片校正放大係數。相機的滿井容量與讀出雜訊決定相位高度的雜訊底，大像素、高幀率與全域快門是優先選項。參考鏡的面形會原封不動加到每一張高度圖上，所以參考鏡用 λ/20 以上的超平面，或以多次平均的平面量測建立參考面扣除檔。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「壓電掃描器、相機與參考鏡」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Vertical scanning moves the objective or the whole interferometric head with a piezo actuator linearised by a capacitive sensor in closed loop, with travel from 100 µm to over 1 mm; long-range instruments switch to a motor with an optical scale. Scanner linearity becomes a height scale error directly, so instruments are calibrated with step-height standards for the amplification coefficient. Camera full-well capacity and read noise set the phase-height noise floor, favouring large pixels, high frame rate and global shutter. The reference mirror's figure is added unchanged to every height map, so the reference is a λ/20 or better superflat, or an averaged flat measurement builds a reference-subtraction file. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Piezo scanner, camera and reference mirror”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：掃描器非線性 0.1% 在 100 µm 行程上造成 100 nm 的高度誤差，對 10 µm 台階為 10 nm，必須以多個高度的步高標準片擬合校正到 0.02% 以下。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 0.1% scanner non-linearity produces 100 nm of height error over 100 µm of travel and 10 nm on a 10 µm step, so calibration against step standards at several heights must bring it below 0.02%.","failure":"常見誤解：「參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「壓電掃描器、相機與參考鏡」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Piezo scanner, camera and reference mirror”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-13-k1","title":"垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質","titleEn":"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality","text":"垂直掃描由壓電致動器帶動物鏡或整個干涉頭，以電容感測器閉迴路線性化，行程從 100 µm 到 1 mm 以上，長行程機型改用馬達配光學尺。掃描器的線性度直接變成高度比例誤差，因此儀器要以步高標準片校正放大係數。","textEn":"Vertical scanning moves the objective or the whole interferometric head with a piezo actuator linearised by a capacitive sensor in closed loop, with travel from 100 µm to over 1 mm; long-range instruments switch to a motor with an optical scale. Scanner linearity becomes a height scale error directly, so instruments are calibrated with step-height standards for the amplification coefficient.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality\" is correct?","options":["參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。","垂直掃描由壓電致動器帶動物鏡或整個干涉頭，以電容感測器閉迴路線性化，行程從 100 µm 到 1 mm 以上，長行程機型改用馬達配光學尺。","儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。"],"optionsEn":["Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted.","Vertical scanning moves the objective or the whole interferometric head with a piezo actuator linearised by a capacitive sensor in closed loop, with travel from 100 µm to over 1 mm.","Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid."],"answer":1,"explanation":"垂直掃描由壓電致動器帶動物鏡或整個干涉頭，以電容感測器閉迴路線性化，行程從 100 µm 到 1 mm 以上，長行程機型改用馬達配光學尺。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Vertical scanning moves the objective or the whole interferometric head with a piezo actuator linearised by a capacitive sensor in closed loop, with travel from 100 µm to over 1 mm; long-range instruments switch to a motor with an optical scale. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a440-v12-14","title":"垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質：定量估算","titleEn":"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「壓電掃描器、相機與參考鏡」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Piezo scanner, camera and reference mirror” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：掃描器非線性 0.1% 在 100 µm 行程上造成 100 nm 的高度誤差，對 10 µm 台階為 10 nm，必須以多個高度的步高標準片擬合校正到 0.02% 以下。參考鏡 λ/20（以 633 nm 計 ≈ 32 nm PV）的面形若不扣除，會在平面量測的 Sz 中直接出現 32 nm；扣除後殘差取決於參考面量測的雜訊，約 0.3 nm。相機 12 位元、滿井 10⁴ 電子時量化步階 2.4 電子，小於光子雜訊 100 電子，量化不是限制。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 0.1% scanner non-linearity produces 100 nm of height error over 100 µm of travel and 10 nm on a 10 µm step, so calibration against step standards at several heights must bring it below 0.02%. A λ/20 reference (≈ 32 nm peak-to-valley at 633 nm) adds 32 nm directly to the Sz of a flat measurement unless subtracted; after subtraction the residual follows the reference-measurement noise, about 0.3 nm. A 12-bit camera with a 10⁴-electron full well has a quantisation step of 2.4 electrons, below the 100-electron photon noise, so quantisation is not the limit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：量 1 µm、10 µm 與 100 µm 三種認證步高標準片，把量測值對證書值作線性擬合，斜率偏差是放大係數誤差、殘差是線性度偏差；以電容感測器的獨立讀值對照壓電命令位置，確認閉迴路線性；在超平面上做 16 次平均建立參考扣除檔，再量另一片超平面確認殘餘平面度偏差小於 1 nm。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure certified step standards of 1 µm, 10 µm and 100 µm, fit measured against certified values, read the amplification-coefficient error from the slope and the linearity deviation from residuals; compare independent capacitive-sensor readings with piezo command positions to confirm closed-loop linearity; average 16 measurements on a superflat to build the reference-subtraction file and measure a second superflat to confirm residual flatness deviation below 1 nm.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"掃描器非線性 0.1% 在 100 µm 行程上造成 100 nm 的高度誤差，對 10 µm 台階為 10 nm，必須以多個高度的步高標準片擬合校正到 0.02% 以下。參考鏡 λ/20（以 633 nm 計 ≈ 32 nm PV）的面形若不扣除，會在平面量測的 Sz 中直接出現 32 nm；扣除後殘差取決於參考面量測的雜訊，約 0.3 nm。相機 12 位元、滿井 10⁴ 電子時量化步階 2.4 電子，小於光子雜訊 100 電子，量化不是限制。","textEn":"A 0.1% scanner non-linearity produces 100 nm of height error over 100 µm of travel and 10 nm on a 10 µm step, so calibration against step standards at several heights must bring it below 0.02%. A λ/20 reference (≈ 32 nm peak-to-valley at 633 nm) adds 32 nm directly to the Sz of a flat measurement unless subtracted; after subtraction the residual follows the reference-measurement noise, about 0.3 nm. A 12-bit camera with a 10⁴-electron full well has a quantisation step of 2.4 electrons, below the 100-electron photon noise, so quantisation is not the limit.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality\", which statement holds?","options":["拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。","白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。","掃描器非線性 0.1% 在 100 µm 行程上造成 100 nm 的高度誤差，對 10 µm 台階為 10 nm，必須以多個高度的步高標準片擬合校正到 0.02% 以下。"],"optionsEn":["Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data.","A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.","A 0.1% scanner non-linearity produces 100 nm of height error over 100 µm of travel and 10 nm on a 10 µm step, so calibration against step standards at several heights must bring it below 0.02%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"掃描器非線性 0.1% 在 100 µm 行程上造成 100 nm 的高度誤差，對 10 µm 台階為 10 nm，必須以多個高度的步高標準片擬合校正到 0.02% 以下。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 0.1% scanner non-linearity produces 100 nm of height error over 100 µm of travel and 10 nm on a 10 µm step, so calibration against step standards at several heights must bring it below 0.02%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a440-v12-15","title":"垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「壓電掃描器、相機與參考鏡」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Piezo scanner, camera and reference mirror” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"量 1 µm、10 µm 與 100 µm 三種認證步高標準片，把量測值對證書值作線性擬合，斜率偏差是放大係數誤差、殘差是線性度偏差；以電容感測器的獨立讀值對照壓電命令位置，確認閉迴路線性；在超平面上做 16 次平均建立參考扣除檔，再量另一片超平面確認殘餘平面度偏差小於 1 nm。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure certified step standards of 1 µm, 10 µm and 100 µm, fit measured against certified values, read the amplification-coefficient error from the slope and the linearity deviation from residuals; compare independent capacitive-sensor readings with piezo command positions to confirm closed-loop linearity; average 16 measurements on a superflat to build the reference-subtraction file and measure a second superflat to confirm residual flatness deviation below 1 nm. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：壓電掃描器的電容感測器受潮漂移後閉迴路仍回報線性，但實際位移比例改變 0.5%，所有台階高度一律偏高 0.5% 而儀器自檢全部通過；只有定期量步高標準片才會發現。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A capacitive sensor that drifts with humidity keeps reporting a linear closed loop while the real displacement scale shifts by 0.5%; every step height reads 0.5% high, all instrument self-tests pass, and only periodic step-standard measurement exposes it.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量 1 µm、10 µm 與 100 µm 三種認證步高標準片，把量測值對證書值作線性擬合，斜率偏差是放大係數誤差、殘差是線性度偏差；以電容感測器的獨立讀值對照壓電命令位置，確認閉迴路線性；在超平面上做 16 次平均建立參考扣除檔，再量另一片超平面確認殘餘平面度偏差小於 1 nm。","textEn":"Measure certified step standards of 1 µm, 10 µm and 100 µm, fit measured against certified values, read the amplification-coefficient error from the slope and the linearity deviation from residuals; compare independent capacitive-sensor readings with piezo command positions to confirm closed-loop linearity; average 16 measurements on a superflat to build the reference-subtraction file and measure a second superflat to confirm residual flatness deviation below 1 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality\"?","options":["量 1 µm、10 µm 與 100 µm 三種認證步高標準片，把量測值對證書值作線性擬合，斜率偏差是放大係數誤差、殘差是線性度偏差。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。"],"optionsEn":["Measure certified step standards of 1 µm, 10 µm and 100 µm, fit measured against certified values, read the amplification-coefficient error from the slope and the linearity deviation from residuals.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used."],"answer":0,"explanation":"量 1 µm、10 µm 與 100 µm 三種認證步高標準片，把量測值對證書值作線性擬合，斜率偏差是放大係數誤差、殘差是線性度偏差；以電容感測器的獨立讀值對照壓電命令位置，確認閉迴路線性；在超平面上做 16 次平均建立參考扣除檔，再量另一片超平面確認殘餘平面度偏差小於 1 nm。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure certified step standards of 1 µm, 10 µm and 100 µm, fit measured against certified values, read the amplification-coefficient error from the slope and the linearity deviation from residuals; compare independent capacitive-sensor readings with piezo command positions to confirm closed-loop linearity; average 16 measurements on a superflat to build the reference-subtraction file and measure a second superflat to confirm residual flatness deviation below 1 nm. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a440-v12-16","title":"垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質：失效診斷","titleEn":"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「壓電掃描器、相機與參考鏡」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Piezo scanner, camera and reference mirror” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"壓電掃描器的電容感測器受潮漂移後閉迴路仍回報線性，但實際位移比例改變 0.5%，所有台階高度一律偏高 0.5% 而儀器自檢全部通過；只有定期量步高標準片才會發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A capacitive sensor that drifts with humidity keeps reporting a linear closed loop while the real displacement scale shifts by 0.5%; every step height reads 0.5% high, all instrument self-tests pass, and only periodic step-standard measurement exposes it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：參考鏡的面形會原封不動加到每一張高度圖上，所以參考鏡用 λ/20 以上的超平面，或以多次平均的平面量測建立參考面扣除檔。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The reference mirror's figure is added unchanged to every height map, so the reference is a λ/20 or better superflat, or an averaged flat measurement builds a reference-subtraction file.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"壓電掃描器的電容感測器受潮漂移後閉迴路仍回報線性，但實際位移比例改變 0.5%，所有台階高度一律偏高 0.5% 而儀器自檢全部通過；只有定期量步高標準片才會發現。","textEn":"A capacitive sensor that drifts with humidity keeps reporting a linear closed loop while the real displacement scale shifts by 0.5%; every step height reads 0.5% high, all instrument self-tests pass, and only periodic step-standard measurement exposes it.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「垂直掃描器、相機雜訊與參考面品質」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Vertical scanner, camera noise and reference-surface quality\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","壓電掃描器的電容感測器受潮漂移後閉迴路仍回報線性，但實際位移比例改變 0.5%，所有台階高度一律偏高 0.5% 而儀器自檢全部通過。","儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A capacitive sensor that drifts with humidity keeps reporting a linear closed loop while the real displacement scale shifts by 0.5%.","Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid."],"answer":1,"explanation":"壓電掃描器的電容感測器受潮漂移後閉迴路仍回報線性，但實際位移比例改變 0.5%，所有台階高度一律偏高 0.5% 而儀器自檢全部通過；只有定期量步高標準片才會發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A capacitive sensor that drifts with humidity keeps reporting a linear closed loop while the real displacement scale shifts by 0.5%; every step height reads 0.5% high, all instrument self-tests pass, and only periodic step-standard measurement exposes it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a440-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正」與「蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale\" and \"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a440-v12-17","title":"放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「ISO 25178-600 計量特性與標準片」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “ISO 25178-600 metrological characteristics and standards” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"ISO 25178-600 把面輪廓儀的校正拆成幾個計量特性：量測雜訊、平面度偏差、放大係數、線性度偏差、x/y 尺度、解析度與垂直對準，各自有對應的實體標準片與程序，ISO 25178-604 則專門描述相干掃描干涉儀。放大係數用步高標準片校正，橫向尺度用已知節距的光柵或網格校正，平面度用超平面，雜訊用重複量測相減。這些結果合起來才能寫出高度、Sa、Sq 與節距等參數的不確定度，而且各特性必須在實際使用的物鏡與視場下分別做。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「ISO 25178-600 計量特性與標準片」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"ISO 25178-600 breaks profilometer calibration into metrological characteristics: measurement noise, flatness deviation, amplification coefficient, linearity deviation, x/y scales, resolution and perpendicularity, each with its own physical standard and procedure, while ISO 25178-604 addresses coherence scanning interferometers specifically. Amplification is calibrated with step-height standards, lateral scale with gratings or grids of known pitch, flatness with a superflat and noise by subtracting repeated measurements. Only together do these results support uncertainty statements for height, Sa, Sq and pitch parameters, and every characteristic must be determined separately for each objective and field of view actually used. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “ISO 25178-600 metrological characteristics and standards”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：放大係數誤差 0.2% 對 10 µm 台階給 20 nm、對 1 µm 台階給 2 nm；橫向尺度誤差 0.3% 在 133 µm 視場上為 0.4 µm，對 10 µm 節距的量測為 30 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 0.2% amplification error gives 20 nm on a 10 µm step and 2 nm on 1 µm; a 0.3% lateral-scale error is 0.4 µm across a 133 µm field and 30 nm on a 10 µm pitch measurement.","failure":"常見誤解：「儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「ISO 25178-600 計量特性與標準片」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “ISO 25178-600 metrological characteristics and standards”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-17-k1","title":"放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正","titleEn":"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale","text":"ISO 25178-600 把面輪廓儀的校正拆成幾個計量特性：量測雜訊、平面度偏差、放大係數、線性度偏差、x/y 尺度、解析度與垂直對準，各自有對應的實體標準片與程序，ISO 25178-604 則專門描述相干掃描干涉儀。放大係數用步高標準片校正，橫向尺度用已知節距的光柵或網格校正，平面度用超平面，雜訊用重複量測相減。","textEn":"ISO 25178-600 breaks profilometer calibration into metrological characteristics: measurement noise, flatness deviation, amplification coefficient, linearity deviation, x/y scales, resolution and perpendicularity, each with its own physical standard and procedure, while ISO 25178-604 addresses coherence scanning interferometers specifically. Amplification is calibrated with step-height standards, lateral scale with gratings or grids of known pitch, flatness with a superflat and noise by subtracting repeated measurements.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale\" is correct?","options":["儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。","光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。","ISO 25178-600 把面輪廓儀的校正拆成幾個計量特性：量測雜訊、平面度偏差、放大係數、線性度偏差、x/y 尺度、解析度與垂直對準，各自有對應的實體標準片與程序，ISO 25178-604 則專門描述相干掃描干涉儀。"],"optionsEn":["Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid.","An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings.","ISO 25178-600 breaks profilometer calibration into metrological characteristics: measurement noise, flatness deviation, amplification coefficient, linearity deviation, x/y scales, resolution and perpendicularity, each with its own physical standard and procedure, while ISO 25178-604 addresses coherence scanning interferometers specifically."],"answer":2,"explanation":"ISO 25178-600 把面輪廓儀的校正拆成幾個計量特性：量測雜訊、平面度偏差、放大係數、線性度偏差、x/y 尺度、解析度與垂直對準，各自有對應的實體標準片與程序，ISO 25178-604 則專門描述相干掃描干涉儀。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"ISO 25178-600 breaks profilometer calibration into metrological characteristics: measurement noise, flatness deviation, amplification coefficient, linearity deviation, x/y scales, resolution and perpendicularity, each with its own physical standard and procedure, while ISO 25178-604 addresses coherence scanning interferometers specifically. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a440-v12-18","title":"放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「ISO 25178-600 計量特性與標準片」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “ISO 25178-600 metrological characteristics and standards” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：放大係數誤差 0.2% 對 10 µm 台階給 20 nm、對 1 µm 台階給 2 nm；橫向尺度誤差 0.3% 在 133 µm 視場上為 0.4 µm，對 10 µm 節距的量測為 30 nm。量測雜訊由兩次量測差的 Sq 除以 √2 得到，例如差圖 Sq = 0.42 nm → 雜訊 0.3 nm；若量測粗糙度 Sq = 2 nm 的表面，雜訊貢獻按均方根扣除後真實值 √(2² − 0.3²) ≈ 1.98 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 0.2% amplification error gives 20 nm on a 10 µm step and 2 nm on 1 µm; a 0.3% lateral-scale error is 0.4 µm across a 133 µm field and 30 nm on a 10 µm pitch measurement. Measurement noise is the Sq of the difference of two measurements divided by √2, for example a difference-map Sq = 0.42 nm → noise 0.3 nm; measuring a surface of Sq = 2 nm and removing the noise in quadrature gives a true value of √(2² − 0.3²) ≈ 1.98 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：依標準片證書建立校正紀錄：每支物鏡量步高（至少兩個高度）、節距光柵（x 與 y 各一方向）、超平面（平面度與雜訊）；把每項結果與允收值比較並記錄環境溫度；每季重複，追蹤放大係數隨時間的漂移曲線，超過 0.1% 即重新校正並回溯影響期間的量測報告。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build a calibration record from certified standards: for each objective measure step heights (at least two values), a pitch grating (in x and y), and a superflat (flatness and noise); compare each result with acceptance limits and log ambient temperature; repeat quarterly, trend the amplification coefficient over time and, when drift exceeds 0.1%, recalibrate and review reports from the affected period.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"放大係數誤差 0.2% 對 10 µm 台階給 20 nm、對 1 µm 台階給 2 nm；橫向尺度誤差 0.3% 在 133 µm 視場上為 0.4 µm，對 10 µm 節距的量測為 30 nm。量測雜訊由兩次量測差的 Sq 除以 √2 得到，例如差圖 Sq = 0.42 nm → 雜訊 0.3 nm；若量測粗糙度 Sq = 2 nm 的表面，雜訊貢獻按均方根扣除後真實值 √(2² − 0.3²) ≈ 1.98 nm。","textEn":"A 0.2% amplification error gives 20 nm on a 10 µm step and 2 nm on 1 µm; a 0.3% lateral-scale error is 0.4 µm across a 133 µm field and 30 nm on a 10 µm pitch measurement. Measurement noise is the Sq of the difference of two measurements divided by √2, for example a difference-map Sq = 0.42 nm → noise 0.3 nm; measuring a surface of Sq = 2 nm and removing the noise in quadrature gives a true value of √(2² − 0.3²) ≈ 1.98 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale\", which statement holds?","options":["放大係數誤差 0.2% 對 10 µm 台階給 20 nm、對 1 µm 台階給 2 nm。","白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。","掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。"],"optionsEn":["A 0.2% amplification error gives 20 nm on a 10 µm step and 2 nm on 1 µm.","White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable.","Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used."],"answer":0,"explanation":"放大係數誤差 0.2% 對 10 µm 台階給 20 nm、對 1 µm 台階給 2 nm；橫向尺度誤差 0.3% 在 133 µm 視場上為 0.4 µm，對 10 µm 節距的量測為 30 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 0.2% amplification error gives 20 nm on a 10 µm step and 2 nm on 1 µm; a 0.3% lateral-scale error is 0.4 µm across a 133 µm field and 30 nm on a 10 µm pitch measurement. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a440-v12-19","title":"放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「ISO 25178-600 計量特性與標準片」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “ISO 25178-600 metrological characteristics and standards” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"依標準片證書建立校正紀錄：每支物鏡量步高（至少兩個高度）、節距光柵（x 與 y 各一方向）、超平面（平面度與雜訊）；把每項結果與允收值比較並記錄環境溫度；每季重複，追蹤放大係數隨時間的漂移曲線，超過 0.1% 即重新校正並回溯影響期間的量測報告。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build a calibration record from certified standards: for each objective measure step heights (at least two values), a pitch grating (in x and y), and a superflat (flatness and noise); compare each result with acceptance limits and log ambient temperature; repeat quarterly, trend the amplification coefficient over time and, when drift exceeds 0.1%, recalibrate and review reports from the affected period. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只在 10× 物鏡上校正放大係數，然後用 50× 物鏡量測；Mirau 物鏡在高數值孔徑下的等效波長變長，放大係數偏差 1% 以上，10 µm 的台階量成 10.1 µm，而校正紀錄看起來完整。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Calibrating amplification only with the 10× objective and then measuring with 50×: at high numerical aperture the Mirau equivalent wavelength lengthens, the amplification coefficient is off by over 1%, a 10 µm step reads 10.1 µm, and the calibration record looks complete.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依標準片證書建立校正紀錄：每支物鏡量步高（至少兩個高度）、節距光柵（x 與 y 各一方向）、超平面（平面度與雜訊）；把每項結果與允收值比較並記錄環境溫度；每季重複，追蹤放大係數隨時間的漂移曲線，超過 0.1% 即重新校正並回溯影響期間的量測報告。","textEn":"Build a calibration record from certified standards: for each objective measure step heights (at least two values), a pitch grating (in x and y), and a superflat (flatness and noise); compare each result with acceptance limits and log ambient temperature; repeat quarterly, trend the amplification coefficient over time and, when drift exceeds 0.1%, recalibrate and review reports from the affected period.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","依標準片證書建立校正紀錄：每支物鏡量步高（至少兩個高度）、節距光柵（x 與 y 各一方向）、超平面（平面度與雜訊）。","倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Build a calibration record from certified standards: for each objective measure step heights (at least two values), a pitch grating (in x and y), and a superflat (flatness and noise).","Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture."],"answer":1,"explanation":"依標準片證書建立校正紀錄：每支物鏡量步高（至少兩個高度）、節距光柵（x 與 y 各一方向）、超平面（平面度與雜訊）；把每項結果與允收值比較並記錄環境溫度；每季重複，追蹤放大係數隨時間的漂移曲線，超過 0.1% 即重新校正並回溯影響期間的量測報告。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build a calibration record from certified standards: for each objective measure step heights (at least two values), a pitch grating (in x and y), and a superflat (flatness and noise); compare each result with acceptance limits and log ambient temperature; repeat quarterly, trend the amplification coefficient over time and, when drift exceeds 0.1%, recalibrate and review reports from the affected period. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a440-v12-20","title":"放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「ISO 25178-600 計量特性與標準片」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “ISO 25178-600 metrological characteristics and standards” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只在 10× 物鏡上校正放大係數，然後用 50× 物鏡量測；Mirau 物鏡在高數值孔徑下的等效波長變長，放大係數偏差 1% 以上，10 µm 的台階量成 10.1 µm，而校正紀錄看起來完整。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Calibrating amplification only with the 10× objective and then measuring with 50×: at high numerical aperture the Mirau equivalent wavelength lengthens, the amplification coefficient is off by over 1%, a 10 µm step reads 10.1 µm, and the calibration record looks complete. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這些結果合起來才能寫出高度、Sa、Sq 與節距等參數的不確定度，而且各特性必須在實際使用的物鏡與視場下分別做。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Only together do these results support uncertainty statements for height, Sa, Sq and pitch parameters, and every characteristic must be determined separately for each objective and field of view actually used.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在 10× 物鏡上校正放大係數，然後用 50× 物鏡量測；Mirau 物鏡在高數值孔徑下的等效波長變長，放大係數偏差 1% 以上，10 µm 的台階量成 10.1 µm，而校正紀錄看起來完整。","textEn":"Calibrating amplification only with the 10× objective and then measuring with 50×: at high numerical aperture the Mirau equivalent wavelength lengthens, the amplification coefficient is off by over 1%, a 10 µm step reads 10.1 µm, and the calibration record looks complete.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「放大係數、雜訊、平面度與橫向尺度的校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Calibrating amplification, noise, flatness and lateral scale\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。","只在 10× 物鏡上校正放大係數，然後用 50× 物鏡量測。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings.","Calibrating amplification only with the 10× objective and then measuring with 50×: at high numerical aperture the Mirau equivalent wavelength lengthens, the amplification coefficient is off by over 1%, a 10 µm step reads 10.1 µm, and the calibration record looks complete."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只在 10× 物鏡上校正放大係數，然後用 50× 物鏡量測；Mirau 物鏡在高數值孔徑下的等效波長變長，放大係數偏差 1% 以上，10 µm 的台階量成 10.1 µm，而校正紀錄看起來完整。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Calibrating amplification only with the 10× objective and then measuring with 50×: at high numerical aperture the Mirau equivalent wavelength lengthens, the amplification coefficient is off by over 1%, a 10 µm step reads 10.1 µm, and the calibration record looks complete. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a440-v12-21","title":"蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「台階邊緣蝙蝠翼與異材相位差」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Batwings at step edges and dissimilar-material phase offset” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"當台階高度小於相干長度時，台階上下兩側的光在邊緣處繞射並互相干涉，包絡被扭曲，高度圖在邊緣兩側出現向外翹起的假尖峰，形狀像蝙蝠翼，幅度可達數十到上百奈米、寬度約等於橫向解析度。不同材料反射時的相位變化不同，例如金屬與介電質，使相位法高度產生與真實幾何無關的偏移。透明薄膜會在上表面與基板界面各產生一組包絡：膜的光學厚度大於相干長度的一半時兩組可分離並可同時量膜厚，否則合併成一個偏移且變寬的包絡，高度與膜厚都錯。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「台階邊緣蝙蝠翼與異材相位差」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When a step is lower than the coherence length, light from the upper and lower levels diffracts at the edge and interferes, the envelope is distorted and false spikes rise outward on both sides of the edge, shaped like bat wings, with amplitudes of tens to over a hundred nanometres and widths about one lateral resolution. Different materials, for example metal versus dielectric, impose different reflection phase changes, so phase-based heights carry offsets unrelated to real geometry. A transparent film produces one envelope at its top surface and another at the substrate interface: if the film's optical thickness exceeds half the coherence length the two separate and thickness can be measured too, otherwise they merge into one shifted, broadened envelope and both height and thickness are wrong. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Batwings at step edges and dissimilar-material phase offset”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：異材偏移 δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π)：鋁與玻璃的反射相位差取 0.3 rad（教學假設）時 δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm，對 100 nm 的金屬線高度是 14% 的誤差。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Dissimilar-material offset δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π): taking a 0.3 rad reflection-phase difference between aluminium and glass (teaching assumption), δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm, a 14% error on a 100 nm metal line.","failure":"常見誤解：「光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「台階邊緣蝙蝠翼與異材相位差」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Batwings at step edges and dissimilar-material phase offset”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-21-k1","title":"蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾","titleEn":"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference","text":"當台階高度小於相干長度時，台階上下兩側的光在邊緣處繞射並互相干涉，包絡被扭曲，高度圖在邊緣兩側出現向外翹起的假尖峰，形狀像蝙蝠翼，幅度可達數十到上百奈米、寬度約等於橫向解析度。不同材料反射時的相位變化不同，例如金屬與介電質，使相位法高度產生與真實幾何無關的偏移。","textEn":"When a step is lower than the coherence length, light from the upper and lower levels diffracts at the edge and interferes, the envelope is distorted and false spikes rise outward on both sides of the edge, shaped like bat wings, with amplitudes of tens to over a hundred nanometres and widths about one lateral resolution. Different materials, for example metal versus dielectric, impose different reflection phase changes, so phase-based heights carry offsets unrelated to real geometry.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference\" is correct?","options":["當台階高度小於相干長度時，台階上下兩側的光在邊緣處繞射並互相干涉，包絡被扭曲，高度圖在邊緣兩側出現向外翹起的假尖峰，形狀像蝙蝠翼，幅度可達數十到上百奈米、寬度約等於橫向解析度。","光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。","拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。"],"optionsEn":["When a step is lower than the coherence length, light from the upper and lower levels diffracts at the edge and interferes, the envelope is distorted and false spikes rise outward on both sides of the edge, shaped like bat wings, with amplitudes of tens to over a hundred nanometres and widths about one lateral resolution.","An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings.","Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data."],"answer":0,"explanation":"當台階高度小於相干長度時，台階上下兩側的光在邊緣處繞射並互相干涉，包絡被扭曲，高度圖在邊緣兩側出現向外翹起的假尖峰，形狀像蝙蝠翼，幅度可達數十到上百奈米、寬度約等於橫向解析度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When a step is lower than the coherence length, light from the upper and lower levels diffracts at the edge and interferes, the envelope is distorted and false spikes rise outward on both sides of the edge, shaped like bat wings, with amplitudes of tens to over a hundred nanometres and widths about one lateral resolution. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a440-v12-22","title":"蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾：定量估算","titleEn":"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「台階邊緣蝙蝠翼與異材相位差」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Batwings at step edges and dissimilar-material phase offset” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：異材偏移 δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π)：鋁與玻璃的反射相位差取 0.3 rad（教學假設）時 δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm，對 100 nm 的金屬線高度是 14% 的誤差。薄膜分離條件 2·n·t > l_c：n = 1.5、l_c = 3.25 µm 時 t > 1.08 µm；100 nm 的氧化層完全落在合併區。蝙蝠翼只在台階 \u003c l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm 時出現，對 300 nm 台階常見，對 10 µm 台階消失。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Dissimilar-material offset δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π): taking a 0.3 rad reflection-phase difference between aluminium and glass (teaching assumption), δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm, a 14% error on a 100 nm metal line. The film-separation condition 2·n·t > l_c with n = 1.5 and l_c = 3.25 µm requires t > 1.08 µm; a 100 nm oxide lies entirely in the merged regime. Batwings appear only for steps below l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm, common at 300 nm and absent at 10 µm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：量一片 300 nm 的矽步高標準片，沿垂直台階的剖面觀察邊緣兩側是否有超過標稱高度的尖峰，比較以包絡法、相位法與軟體的邊緣抑制演算法得到的台階寬度與高度；異材偏移以金屬線跨越玻璃的樣品，用原子力顯微鏡或觸針式輪廓儀量真實高度，差值即相位偏移，寫進材料修正表。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure a 300 nm silicon step standard and inspect a profile across the edge for spikes exceeding the nominal height on both sides, comparing step width and height from envelope, phase and the software's edge-suppression algorithms; for dissimilar-material offset use a metal line crossing glass, measure the true height with an atomic-force microscope or stylus profiler, and enter the difference as a phase offset in the material-correction table.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"異材偏移 δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π)：鋁與玻璃的反射相位差取 0.3 rad（教學假設）時 δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm，對 100 nm 的金屬線高度是 14% 的誤差。薄膜分離條件 2·n·t > l_c：n = 1.5、l_c = 3.25 µm 時 t > 1.08 µm；100 nm 的氧化層完全落在合併區。蝙蝠翼只在台階 \u003c l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm 時出現，對 300 nm 台階常見，對 10 µm 台階消失。","textEn":"Dissimilar-material offset δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π): taking a 0.3 rad reflection-phase difference between aluminium and glass (teaching assumption), δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm, a 14% error on a 100 nm metal line. The film-separation condition 2·n·t > l_c with n = 1.5 and l_c = 3.25 µm requires t > 1.08 µm; a 100 nm oxide lies entirely in the merged regime. Batwings appear only for steps below l_c/2 ≈ 1.6 µm, common at 300 nm and absent at 10 µm.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference\", which statement holds?","options":["白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。","異材偏移 δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π)：鋁與玻璃的反射相位差取 0.3 rad（教學假設）時 δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm，對 100 nm 的金屬線高度是 14% 的誤差。","倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。"],"optionsEn":["A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.","Dissimilar-material offset δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π): taking a 0.3 rad reflection-phase difference between aluminium and glass (teaching assumption), δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm, a 14% error on a 100 nm metal line.","Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture."],"answer":1,"explanation":"異材偏移 δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π)：鋁與玻璃的反射相位差取 0.3 rad（教學假設）時 δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm，對 100 nm 的金屬線高度是 14% 的誤差。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Dissimilar-material offset δh = Δφ·λ₀/(4π): taking a 0.3 rad reflection-phase difference between aluminium and glass (teaching assumption), δh ≈ 0.3×570/(4π) ≈ 13.6 nm, a 14% error on a 100 nm metal line. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a440-v12-23","title":"蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「台階邊緣蝙蝠翼與異材相位差」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Batwings at step edges and dissimilar-material phase offset” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"量一片 300 nm 的矽步高標準片，沿垂直台階的剖面觀察邊緣兩側是否有超過標稱高度的尖峰，比較以包絡法、相位法與軟體的邊緣抑制演算法得到的台階寬度與高度；異材偏移以金屬線跨越玻璃的樣品，用原子力顯微鏡或觸針式輪廓儀量真實高度，差值即相位偏移，寫進材料修正表。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure a 300 nm silicon step standard and inspect a profile across the edge for spikes exceeding the nominal height on both sides, comparing step width and height from envelope, phase and the software's edge-suppression algorithms; for dissimilar-material offset use a metal line crossing glass, measure the true height with an atomic-force microscope or stylus profiler, and enter the difference as a phase offset in the material-correction table. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把帶蝙蝠翼的剖面直接拿去算線寬，邊緣位置被假尖峰拉偏 0.5 µm，線寬量測系統性偏小；若再用相位法量金屬圖案在玻璃上的高度而沒有材料修正，每條線都偏 14 nm，製程視窗被誤判。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Using a profile with batwings to compute line width lets the false spikes pull the edge position by 0.5 µm and the width reads systematically narrow; measuring metal-on-glass heights by the phase method without material correction then biases every line by 14 nm and the process window is misjudged.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量一片 300 nm 的矽步高標準片，沿垂直台階的剖面觀察邊緣兩側是否有超過標稱高度的尖峰，比較以包絡法、相位法與軟體的邊緣抑制演算法得到的台階寬度與高度；異材偏移以金屬線跨越玻璃的樣品，用原子力顯微鏡或觸針式輪廓儀量真實高度，差值即相位偏移，寫進材料修正表。","textEn":"Measure a 300 nm silicon step standard and inspect a profile across the edge for spikes exceeding the nominal height on both sides, comparing step width and height from envelope, phase and the software's edge-suppression algorithms; for dissimilar-material offset use a metal line crossing glass, measure the true height with an atomic-force microscope or stylus profiler, and enter the difference as a phase offset in the material-correction table.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。","量一片 300 nm 的矽步高標準片，沿垂直台階的剖面觀察邊緣兩側是否有超過標稱高度的尖峰，比較以包絡法、相位法與軟體的邊緣抑制演算法得到的台階寬度與高度。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted.","Measure a 300 nm silicon step standard and inspect a profile across the edge for spikes exceeding the nominal height on both sides, comparing step width and height from envelope, phase and the software's edge-suppression algorithms."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量一片 300 nm 的矽步高標準片，沿垂直台階的剖面觀察邊緣兩側是否有超過標稱高度的尖峰，比較以包絡法、相位法與軟體的邊緣抑制演算法得到的台階寬度與高度；異材偏移以金屬線跨越玻璃的樣品，用原子力顯微鏡或觸針式輪廓儀量真實高度，差值即相位偏移，寫進材料修正表。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure a 300 nm silicon step standard and inspect a profile across the edge for spikes exceeding the nominal height on both sides, comparing step width and height from envelope, phase and the software's edge-suppression algorithms; for dissimilar-material offset use a metal line crossing glass, measure the true height with an atomic-force microscope or stylus profiler, and enter the difference as a phase offset in the material-correction table. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a440-v12-24","title":"蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾：失效診斷","titleEn":"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「台階邊緣蝙蝠翼與異材相位差」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Batwings at step edges and dissimilar-material phase offset” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把帶蝙蝠翼的剖面直接拿去算線寬，邊緣位置被假尖峰拉偏 0.5 µm，線寬量測系統性偏小；若再用相位法量金屬圖案在玻璃上的高度而沒有材料修正，每條線都偏 14 nm，製程視窗被誤判。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Using a profile with batwings to compute line width lets the false spikes pull the edge position by 0.5 µm and the width reads systematically narrow; measuring metal-on-glass heights by the phase method without material correction then biases every line by 14 nm and the process window is misjudged. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：透明薄膜會在上表面與基板界面各產生一組包絡：膜的光學厚度大於相干長度的一半時兩組可分離並可同時量膜厚，否則合併成一個偏移且變寬的包絡，高度與膜厚都錯。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A transparent film produces one envelope at its top surface and another at the substrate interface: if the film's optical thickness exceeds half the coherence length the two separate and thickness can be measured too, otherwise they merge into one shifted, broadened envelope and both height and thickness are wrong.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把帶蝙蝠翼的剖面直接拿去算線寬，邊緣位置被假尖峰拉偏 0.5 µm，線寬量測系統性偏小；若再用相位法量金屬圖案在玻璃上的高度而沒有材料修正，每條線都偏 14 nm，製程視窗被誤判。","textEn":"Using a profile with batwings to compute line width lets the false spikes pull the edge position by 0.5 µm and the width reads systematically narrow; measuring metal-on-glass heights by the phase method without material correction then biases every line by 14 nm and the process window is misjudged.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「蝙蝠翼、異材相位與薄膜干擾」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Batwing artefacts, dissimilar-material phase and thin-film interference\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把帶蝙蝠翼的剖面直接拿去算線寬，邊緣位置被假尖峰拉偏 0.5 µm，線寬量測系統性偏小。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。"],"optionsEn":["Using a profile with batwings to compute line width lets the false spikes pull the edge position by 0.5 µm and the width reads systematically narrow.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把帶蝙蝠翼的剖面直接拿去算線寬，邊緣位置被假尖峰拉偏 0.5 µm，線寬量測系統性偏小；若再用相位法量金屬圖案在玻璃上的高度而沒有材料修正，每條線都偏 14 nm，製程視窗被誤判。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a profile with batwings to compute line width lets the false spikes pull the edge position by 0.5 µm and the width reads systematically narrow; measuring metal-on-glass heights by the phase method without material correction then biases every line by 14 nm and the process window is misjudged. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a440-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能」與「與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput\" and \"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a440-v12-25","title":"產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「隔振平台、拼接與自動化」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Vibration isolation, stitching and automation” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"相干掃描需要數秒，掃描期間任何相對於樣品的垂直振動都會扭曲相干圖，條紋相位對振動的靈敏度是 4π/λ₀，所以儀器安放在被動或主動隔振平台上並封在防風罩內；產線機型用高幀率相機縮短掃描時間，使振動更難進入。大面積量測以自動平台把多個視場拼接，相鄰視場重疊 20% 左右，用重疊區的高度差解出每個視場的活塞與傾斜，但誤差會沿拼接鏈累積。自動化還包含自動對焦找包絡、自動光強與自動樣品辨識，產能由掃描長度、幀率與拼接數決定。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「隔振平台、拼接與自動化」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A coherence scan takes seconds, and any vertical vibration between instrument and sample during that time distorts the correlogram, the fringe phase being sensitive to vibration by 4π/λ₀, so instruments sit on passive or active isolation inside draught enclosures; production models use high-frame-rate cameras to shorten scans and shut vibration out. Large areas are covered by stitching fields with an automated stage, overlapping neighbours by about 20% and solving each field's piston and tilt from the overlap, but errors accumulate along the stitching chain. Automation adds auto-focus to find the envelope, auto-intensity and sample recognition, and throughput follows scan length, frame rate and the number of fields. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Vibration isolation, stitching and automation”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：振動幅度 10 nm 造成的條紋相位誤差 = 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad，相當於 10 nm 的高度誤差，比 0.14 nm 的光子雜訊大 70 倍，所以隔振平台需把 10 到 100 Hz 的振動壓到 1 nm 以下。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 10 nm vibration amplitude gives a fringe-phase error of 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad, equivalent to 10 nm of height error, 70 times the 0.14 nm photon noise, so the isolation platform must hold 10 to 100 Hz vibration below 1 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「隔振平台、拼接與自動化」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Vibration isolation, stitching and automation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-25-k1","title":"產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能","titleEn":"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput","text":"相干掃描需要數秒，掃描期間任何相對於樣品的垂直振動都會扭曲相干圖，條紋相位對振動的靈敏度是 4π/λ₀，所以儀器安放在被動或主動隔振平台上並封在防風罩內；產線機型用高幀率相機縮短掃描時間，使振動更難進入。大面積量測以自動平台把多個視場拼接，相鄰視場重疊 20% 左右，用重疊區的高度差解出每個視場的活塞與傾斜，但誤差會沿拼接鏈累積。","textEn":"A coherence scan takes seconds, and any vertical vibration between instrument and sample during that time distorts the correlogram, the fringe phase being sensitive to vibration by 4π/λ₀, so instruments sit on passive or active isolation inside draught enclosures; production models use high-frame-rate cameras to shorten scans and shut vibration out. Large areas are covered by stitching fields with an automated stage, overlapping neighbours by about 20% and solving each field's piston and tilt from the overlap, but errors accumulate along the stitching chain.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput\" is correct?","options":["拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。","相干掃描需要數秒，掃描期間任何相對於樣品的垂直振動都會扭曲相干圖，條紋相位對振動的靈敏度是 4π/λ₀，所以儀器安放在被動或主動隔振平台上並封在防風罩內。","白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data.","A coherence scan takes seconds, and any vertical vibration between instrument and sample during that time distorts the correlogram, the fringe phase being sensitive to vibration by 4π/λ₀, so instruments sit on passive or active isolation inside draught enclosures.","White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"相干掃描需要數秒，掃描期間任何相對於樣品的垂直振動都會扭曲相干圖，條紋相位對振動的靈敏度是 4π/λ₀，所以儀器安放在被動或主動隔振平台上並封在防風罩內；產線機型用高幀率相機縮短掃描時間，使振動更難進入。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A coherence scan takes seconds, and any vertical vibration between instrument and sample during that time distorts the correlogram, the fringe phase being sensitive to vibration by 4π/λ₀, so instruments sit on passive or active isolation inside draught enclosures; production models use high-frame-rate cameras to shorten scans and shut vibration out. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a440-v12-26","title":"產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能：定量估算","titleEn":"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「隔振平台、拼接與自動化」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Vibration isolation, stitching and automation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：振動幅度 10 nm 造成的條紋相位誤差 = 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad，相當於 10 nm 的高度誤差，比 0.14 nm 的光子雜訊大 70 倍，所以隔振平台需把 10 到 100 Hz 的振動壓到 1 nm 以下。拼接 10 個 133 µm 視場成 1.1 mm：每個視場殘餘傾斜 10 µrad 的累積高度誤差 ≈ 10×133 µm×10 µrad ≈ 13 nm；產能估算：每視場掃 20 µm 需 2.8 s，加 1 s 移動，100 個視場需約 6.3 min。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 10 nm vibration amplitude gives a fringe-phase error of 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad, equivalent to 10 nm of height error, 70 times the 0.14 nm photon noise, so the isolation platform must hold 10 to 100 Hz vibration below 1 nm. Stitching 10 fields of 133 µm into 1.1 mm: a residual tilt of 10 µrad per field accumulates a height error of ≈ 10×133 µm×10 µrad ≈ 13 nm; throughput: each field needs 2.8 s for a 20 µm scan plus 1 s of travel, so 100 fields take about 6.3 min. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用加速規量儀器基座在 1 到 200 Hz 的振動譜，與未隔振的地面比較，並在開啟附近設備時重複平面雜訊量測，確認雜訊不上升；拼接驗證用一片跨越多個視場的認證平面或長節距光柵，比較拼接高度圖的整體平面度與節距累積誤差和單一視場的結果。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the instrument base's 1 to 200 Hz vibration spectrum with an accelerometer against the unisolated floor, and repeat the flat-noise measurement with nearby equipment switched on to confirm the noise does not rise; validate stitching with a certified flat or long-pitch grating spanning several fields, comparing the stitched map's overall flatness and cumulative pitch error with single-field results.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"振動幅度 10 nm 造成的條紋相位誤差 = 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad，相當於 10 nm 的高度誤差，比 0.14 nm 的光子雜訊大 70 倍，所以隔振平台需把 10 到 100 Hz 的振動壓到 1 nm 以下。拼接 10 個 133 µm 視場成 1.1 mm：每個視場殘餘傾斜 10 µrad 的累積高度誤差 ≈ 10×133 µm×10 µrad ≈ 13 nm；產能估算：每視場掃 20 µm 需 2.8 s，加 1 s 移動，100 個視場需約 6.3 min。","textEn":"A 10 nm vibration amplitude gives a fringe-phase error of 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad, equivalent to 10 nm of height error, 70 times the 0.14 nm photon noise, so the isolation platform must hold 10 to 100 Hz vibration below 1 nm. Stitching 10 fields of 133 µm into 1.1 mm: a residual tilt of 10 µrad per field accumulates a height error of ≈ 10×133 µm×10 µrad ≈ 13 nm; throughput: each field needs 2.8 s for a 20 µm scan plus 1 s of travel, so 100 fields take about 6.3 min.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput\", which statement holds?","options":["掃描步距越小高度越準，所以應該總是用最小步距。","參考鏡的面形誤差會在兩次量測相減時自動消失。","振動幅度 10 nm 造成的條紋相位誤差 = 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad，相當於 10 nm 的高度誤差，比 0.14 nm 的光子雜訊大 70 倍，所以隔振平台需把 10 到 100 Hz 的振動壓到 1 nm 以下。"],"optionsEn":["Smaller scan steps always give more accurate height, so the finest step should always be used.","Reference-mirror figure error cancels automatically when two measurements are subtracted.","A 10 nm vibration amplitude gives a fringe-phase error of 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad, equivalent to 10 nm of height error, 70 times the 0.14 nm photon noise, so the isolation platform must hold 10 to 100 Hz vibration below 1 nm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"振動幅度 10 nm 造成的條紋相位誤差 = 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad，相當於 10 nm 的高度誤差，比 0.14 nm 的光子雜訊大 70 倍，所以隔振平台需把 10 到 100 Hz 的振動壓到 1 nm 以下。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 10 nm vibration amplitude gives a fringe-phase error of 4π×10/570 ≈ 0.22 rad, equivalent to 10 nm of height error, 70 times the 0.14 nm photon noise, so the isolation platform must hold 10 to 100 Hz vibration below 1 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a440-v12-27","title":"產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「隔振平台、拼接與自動化」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Vibration isolation, stitching and automation” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用加速規量儀器基座在 1 到 200 Hz 的振動譜，與未隔振的地面比較，並在開啟附近設備時重複平面雜訊量測，確認雜訊不上升；拼接驗證用一片跨越多個視場的認證平面或長節距光柵，比較拼接高度圖的整體平面度與節距累積誤差和單一視場的結果。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the instrument base's 1 to 200 Hz vibration spectrum with an accelerometer against the unisolated floor, and repeat the flat-noise measurement with nearby equipment switched on to confirm the noise does not rise; validate stitching with a certified flat or long-pitch grating spanning several fields, comparing the stitched map's overall flatness and cumulative pitch error with single-field results. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：產線上空調風直接吹向未封罩的干涉頭，空氣折射率在掃描中擾動，相干圖包絡抖動，高度圖出現與掃描同步的波紋；因為是週期性的，被誤判為樣品的真實紋理。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Air-conditioning draught on an unenclosed interferometric head perturbs the air index during the scan, the envelope wobbles and the height map shows ripples synchronous with the scan; being periodic, they are misread as real sample texture.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用加速規量儀器基座在 1 到 200 Hz 的振動譜，與未隔振的地面比較，並在開啟附近設備時重複平面雜訊量測，確認雜訊不上升；拼接驗證用一片跨越多個視場的認證平面或長節距光柵，比較拼接高度圖的整體平面度與節距累積誤差和單一視場的結果。","textEn":"Measure the instrument base's 1 to 200 Hz vibration spectrum with an accelerometer against the unisolated floor, and repeat the flat-noise measurement with nearby equipment switched on to confirm the noise does not rise; validate stitching with a certified flat or long-pitch grating spanning several fields, comparing the stitched map's overall flatness and cumulative pitch error with single-field results.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput\"?","options":["用加速規量儀器基座在 1 到 200 Hz 的振動譜，與未隔振的地面比較，並在開啟附近設備時重複平面雜訊量測，確認雜訊不上升。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the instrument base's 1 to 200 Hz vibration spectrum with an accelerometer against the unisolated floor, and repeat the flat-noise measurement with nearby equipment switched on to confirm the noise does not rise.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用加速規量儀器基座在 1 到 200 Hz 的振動譜，與未隔振的地面比較，並在開啟附近設備時重複平面雜訊量測，確認雜訊不上升；拼接驗證用一片跨越多個視場的認證平面或長節距光柵，比較拼接高度圖的整體平面度與節距累積誤差和單一視場的結果。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the instrument base's 1 to 200 Hz vibration spectrum with an accelerometer against the unisolated floor, and repeat the flat-noise measurement with nearby equipment switched on to confirm the noise does not rise; validate stitching with a certified flat or long-pitch grating spanning several fields, comparing the stitched map's overall flatness and cumulative pitch error with single-field results. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a440-v12-28","title":"產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能：失效診斷","titleEn":"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「隔振平台、拼接與自動化」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Vibration isolation, stitching and automation” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"產線上空調風直接吹向未封罩的干涉頭，空氣折射率在掃描中擾動，相干圖包絡抖動，高度圖出現與掃描同步的波紋；因為是週期性的，被誤判為樣品的真實紋理。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Air-conditioning draught on an unenclosed interferometric head perturbs the air index during the scan, the envelope wobbles and the height map shows ripples synchronous with the scan; being periodic, they are misread as real sample texture. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：自動化還包含自動對焦找包絡、自動光強與自動樣品辨識，產能由掃描長度、幀率與拼接數決定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Automation adds auto-focus to find the envelope, auto-intensity and sample recognition, and throughput follows scan length, frame rate and the number of fields.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「拼接視場越多量測越準，因為資料更多。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Stitching more fields makes the measurement more accurate because there is more data.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"產線上空調風直接吹向未封罩的干涉頭，空氣折射率在掃描中擾動，相干圖包絡抖動，高度圖出現與掃描同步的波紋；因為是週期性的，被誤判為樣品的真實紋理。","textEn":"Air-conditioning draught on an unenclosed interferometric head perturbs the air index during the scan, the envelope wobbles and the height map shows ripples synchronous with the scan; being periodic, they are misread as real sample texture.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「產線整合：隔振、視場拼接與產能」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Production integration: vibration, field stitching and throughput\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","產線上空調風直接吹向未封罩的干涉頭，空氣折射率在掃描中擾動，相干圖包絡抖動，高度圖出現與掃描同步的波紋；因為是週期性的，被誤判為樣品的真實紋理。","白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Air-conditioning draught on an unenclosed interferometric head perturbs the air index during the scan, the envelope wobbles and the height map shows ripples synchronous with the scan.","White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"產線上空調風直接吹向未封罩的干涉頭，空氣折射率在掃描中擾動，相干圖包絡抖動，高度圖出現與掃描同步的波紋；因為是週期性的，被誤判為樣品的真實紋理。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Air-conditioning draught on an unenclosed interferometric head perturbs the air index during the scan, the envelope wobbles and the height map shows ripples synchronous with the scan; being periodic, they are misread as real sample texture. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a440-v12-29","title":"與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「不確定度預算與交接報告」如何決定白光干涉表面輪廓儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Uncertainty budget and handoff report” determines the key performance of “White-light interferometric profilometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"交付前要用獨立方法驗證：觸針式輪廓儀與原子力顯微鏡對材料相位不敏感，可用來比對台階高度與粗糙度；兩者的差異若落在合成不確定度內，表示材料修正與校正都正確。粗糙度參數還依賴濾波：ISO 25178 的 S 濾波（去除雜訊）與 L 濾波（去除形狀）截止值必須與比對方法一致，否則 Sa 與 Sq 不可比。交接報告列出每個計量特性的校正值與日期、各物鏡的不確定度預算、材料修正表、濾波設定與禁用條件（斜率、薄膜、台階高度範圍）。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「不確定度預算與交接報告」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Before handoff, validate with independent methods: stylus profilers and atomic-force microscopes are insensitive to material phase and serve to compare step heights and roughness; agreement within the combined uncertainty shows that material corrections and calibrations are right. Roughness parameters also depend on filtering: the ISO 25178 S-filter (noise removal) and L-filter (form removal) cut-offs must match the comparison method or Sa and Sq are not comparable. The handoff report lists each metrological characteristic with its calibrated value and date, an uncertainty budget per objective, the material-correction table, filter settings and exclusion conditions (slope, thin films, step-height range). Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Uncertainty budget and handoff report”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：1 µm 台階的不確定度預算（教學假設，標準不確定度）：放大係數 0.2% → 2 nm；量測雜訊 0.3 nm；參考面殘餘平面度 2 nm；步高標準片證書 2 nm；蝙蝠翼邊緣排除後的取樣區選擇 1 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Uncertainty budget for a 1 µm step (teaching assumptions, standard uncertainties): amplification 0.2% → 2 nm; measurement noise 0.3 nm; residual reference flatness 2 nm; step-standard certificate 2 nm; sampling-region choice after excluding batwing edges 1 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「不確定度預算與交接報告」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Uncertainty budget and handoff report”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-29-k1","title":"與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接","titleEn":"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff","text":"交付前要用獨立方法驗證：觸針式輪廓儀與原子力顯微鏡對材料相位不敏感，可用來比對台階高度與粗糙度；兩者的差異若落在合成不確定度內，表示材料修正與校正都正確。粗糙度參數還依賴濾波：ISO 25178 的 S 濾波（去除雜訊）與 L 濾波（去除形狀）截止值必須與比對方法一致，否則 Sa 與 Sq 不可比。","textEn":"Before handoff, validate with independent methods: stylus profilers and atomic-force microscopes are insensitive to material phase and serve to compare step heights and roughness; agreement within the combined uncertainty shows that material corrections and calibrations are right. Roughness parameters also depend on filtering: the ISO 25178 S-filter (noise removal) and L-filter (form removal) cut-offs must match the comparison method or Sa and Sq are not comparable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。","白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。","交付前要用獨立方法驗證：觸針式輪廓儀與原子力顯微鏡對材料相位不敏感，可用來比對台階高度與粗糙度；兩者的差異若落在合成不確定度內，表示材料修正與校正都正確。"],"optionsEn":["White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable.","A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.","Before handoff, validate with independent methods: stylus profilers and atomic-force microscopes are insensitive to material phase and serve to compare step heights and roughness."],"answer":2,"explanation":"交付前要用獨立方法驗證：觸針式輪廓儀與原子力顯微鏡對材料相位不敏感，可用來比對台階高度與粗糙度；兩者的差異若落在合成不確定度內，表示材料修正與校正都正確。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Before handoff, validate with independent methods: stylus profilers and atomic-force microscopes are insensitive to material phase and serve to compare step heights and roughness; agreement within the combined uncertainty shows that material corrections and calibrations are right. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a440-v12-30","title":"與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「不確定度預算與交接報告」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Uncertainty budget and handoff report” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：1 µm 台階的不確定度預算（教學假設，標準不確定度）：放大係數 0.2% → 2 nm；量測雜訊 0.3 nm；參考面殘餘平面度 2 nm；步高標準片證書 2 nm；蝙蝠翼邊緣排除後的取樣區選擇 1 nm。RSS = √(2² + 0.3² + 2² + 2² + 1²) ≈ 3.6 nm，k = 2 擴展不確定度 ≈ 7 nm，即 0.7%。與觸針式輪廓儀的比對差若為 5 nm，落在兩者合成不確定度內，驗證通過。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Uncertainty budget for a 1 µm step (teaching assumptions, standard uncertainties): amplification 0.2% → 2 nm; measurement noise 0.3 nm; residual reference flatness 2 nm; step-standard certificate 2 nm; sampling-region choice after excluding batwing edges 1 nm. RSS = √(2² + 0.3² + 2² + 2² + 1²) ≈ 3.6 nm, expanded uncertainty at k = 2 ≈ 7 nm, that is 0.7%. A 5 nm difference against a stylus profiler lies within the combined uncertainty of both, so validation passes. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：選三件代表性工件（光滑矽片、金屬台階、粗糙磨削面），分別以白光干涉儀、觸針式輪廓儀與 AFM 在同一區域、同樣的 S/L 濾波下量 Sa、Sq 與台階高度，製作比對表並計算歸一化誤差 E_n = 差值/√(U₁² + U₂²)，E_n \u003c 1 才簽收；報告附上各物鏡的校正證書與材料修正紀錄。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Choose three representative parts (smooth silicon, a metal step, a rough ground surface), measure Sa, Sq and step height on the same region with the white-light interferometer, a stylus profiler and an AFM under identical S/L filters, tabulate the comparison and compute the normalised error E_n = difference/√(U₁² + U₂²), signing off only when E_n \u003c 1; attach each objective's calibration certificate and the material-correction record to the report.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"1 µm 台階的不確定度預算（教學假設，標準不確定度）：放大係數 0.2% → 2 nm；量測雜訊 0.3 nm；參考面殘餘平面度 2 nm；步高標準片證書 2 nm；蝙蝠翼邊緣排除後的取樣區選擇 1 nm。RSS = √(2² + 0.3² + 2² + 2² + 1²) ≈ 3.6 nm，k = 2 擴展不確定度 ≈ 7 nm，即 0.7%。與觸針式輪廓儀的比對差若為 5 nm，落在兩者合成不確定度內，驗證通過。","textEn":"Uncertainty budget for a 1 µm step (teaching assumptions, standard uncertainties): amplification 0.2% → 2 nm; measurement noise 0.3 nm; residual reference flatness 2 nm; step-standard certificate 2 nm; sampling-region choice after excluding batwing edges 1 nm. RSS = √(2² + 0.3² + 2² + 2² + 1²) ≈ 3.6 nm, expanded uncertainty at k = 2 ≈ 7 nm, that is 0.7%. A 5 nm difference against a stylus profiler lies within the combined uncertainty of both, so validation passes.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["1 µm 台階的不確定度預算（教學假設，標準不確定度）：放大係數 0.2% → 2 nm。","倍率越高橫向解析度越好，與數值孔徑無關。","儀器開機自檢通過就代表校正有效。"],"optionsEn":["Uncertainty budget for a 1 µm step (teaching assumptions, standard uncertainties): amplification 0.2% → 2 nm.","Higher magnification always means better lateral resolution regardless of numerical aperture.","Passing the instrument's start-up self-test means the calibration is valid."],"answer":0,"explanation":"1 µm 台階的不確定度預算（教學假設，標準不確定度）：放大係數 0.2% → 2 nm；量測雜訊 0.3 nm；參考面殘餘平面度 2 nm；步高標準片證書 2 nm；蝙蝠翼邊緣排除後的取樣區選擇 1 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Uncertainty budget for a 1 µm step (teaching assumptions, standard uncertainties): amplification 0.2% → 2 nm; measurement noise 0.3 nm; residual reference flatness 2 nm; step-standard certificate 2 nm; sampling-region choice after excluding batwing edges 1 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a440-v12-31","title":"與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「不確定度預算與交接報告」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Uncertainty budget and handoff report” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"選三件代表性工件（光滑矽片、金屬台階、粗糙磨削面），分別以白光干涉儀、觸針式輪廓儀與 AFM 在同一區域、同樣的 S/L 濾波下量 Sa、Sq 與台階高度，製作比對表並計算歸一化誤差 E_n = 差值/√(U₁² + U₂²)，E_n \u003c 1 才簽收；報告附上各物鏡的校正證書與材料修正紀錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Choose three representative parts (smooth silicon, a metal step, a rough ground surface), measure Sa, Sq and step height on the same region with the white-light interferometer, a stylus profiler and an AFM under identical S/L filters, tabulate the comparison and compute the normalised error E_n = difference/√(U₁² + U₂²), signing off only when E_n \u003c 1; attach each objective's calibration certificate and the material-correction record to the report. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：交接時只給 Sa 數值而不附濾波截止與物鏡，使用者用另一台儀器以不同 L 濾波量到 Sa 差了 40%，雙方各自堅持儀器正確，爭議拖延數週才發現是濾波定義不同。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A handoff that gives Sa values without filter cut-offs or objective lets the user measure 40% different Sa on another instrument with a different L-filter; both sides defend their instruments and weeks pass before the filter definition is found to be the cause.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"選三件代表性工件（光滑矽片、金屬台階、粗糙磨削面），分別以白光干涉儀、觸針式輪廓儀與 AFM 在同一區域、同樣的 S/L 濾波下量 Sa、Sq 與台階高度，製作比對表並計算歸一化誤差 E_n = 差值/√(U₁² + U₂²)，E_n \u003c 1 才簽收；報告附上各物鏡的校正證書與材料修正紀錄。","textEn":"Choose three representative parts (smooth silicon, a metal step, a rough ground surface), measure Sa, Sq and step height on the same region with the white-light interferometer, a stylus profiler and an AFM under identical S/L filters, tabulate the comparison and compute the normalised error E_n = difference/√(U₁² + U₂²), signing off only when E_n \u003c 1; attach each objective's calibration certificate and the material-correction record to the report.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","選三件代表性工件（光滑矽片、金屬台階、粗糙磨削面），分別以白光干涉儀、觸針式輪廓儀與 AFM 在同一區域、同樣的 S/L 濾波下量 Sa、Sq 與台階高度，製作比對表並計算歸一化誤差 E_n = 差值/√(U₁² + U₂²)，E_n \u003c 1 才簽收。","光學輪廓儀量的是幾何表面，所以材料不影響高度讀值。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Choose three representative parts (smooth silicon, a metal step, a rough ground surface), measure Sa, Sq and step height on the same region with the white-light interferometer, a stylus profiler and an AFM under identical S/L filters, tabulate the comparison and compute the normalised error E_n = difference/√(U₁² + U₂²), signing off only when E_n \u003c 1.","An optical profilometer measures geometric surface, so material does not affect height readings."],"answer":1,"explanation":"選三件代表性工件（光滑矽片、金屬台階、粗糙磨削面），分別以白光干涉儀、觸針式輪廓儀與 AFM 在同一區域、同樣的 S/L 濾波下量 Sa、Sq 與台階高度，製作比對表並計算歸一化誤差 E_n = 差值/√(U₁² + U₂²)，E_n \u003c 1 才簽收；報告附上各物鏡的校正證書與材料修正紀錄。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Choose three representative parts (smooth silicon, a metal step, a rough ground surface), measure Sa, Sq and step height on the same region with the white-light interferometer, a stylus profiler and an AFM under identical S/L filters, tabulate the comparison and compute the normalised error E_n = difference/√(U₁² + U₂²), signing off only when E_n \u003c 1; attach each objective's calibration certificate and the material-correction record to the report. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a440-v12-32","title":"與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"prerequisiteIds":["a440-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「不確定度預算與交接報告」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Uncertainty budget and handoff report” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"交接時只給 Sa 數值而不附濾波截止與物鏡，使用者用另一台儀器以不同 L 濾波量到 Sa 差了 40%，雙方各自堅持儀器正確，爭議拖延數週才發現是濾波定義不同。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A handoff that gives Sa values without filter cut-offs or objective lets the user measure 40% different Sa on another instrument with a different L-filter; both sides defend their instruments and weeks pass before the filter definition is found to be the cause. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接報告列出每個計量特性的校正值與日期、各物鏡的不確定度預算、材料修正表、濾波設定與禁用條件（斜率、薄膜、台階高度範圍）。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff report lists each metrological characteristic with its calibrated value and date, an uncertainty budget per objective, the material-correction table, filter settings and exclusion conditions (slope, thin films, step-height range).","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「白光干涉儀的粗糙度讀值和觸針式輪廓儀的 Ra 可以直接互換。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"White-light roughness readings and stylus Ra values are directly interchangeable.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a440-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"交接時只給 Sa 數值而不附濾波截止與物鏡，使用者用另一台儀器以不同 L 濾波量到 Sa 差了 40%，雙方各自堅持儀器正確，爭議拖延數週才發現是濾波定義不同。","textEn":"A handoff that gives Sa values without filter cut-offs or objective lets the user measure 40% different Sa on another instrument with a different L-filter; both sides defend their instruments and weeks pass before the filter definition is found to be the cause.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]},{"id":"a440-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「與觸針／AFM 比對、不確定度與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Comparison with stylus/AFM, uncertainty and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","白光干涉儀的高度解析度等於相干長度。","交接時只給 Sa 數值而不附濾波截止與物鏡，使用者用另一台儀器以不同 L 濾波量到 Sa 差了 40%，雙方各自堅持儀器正確，爭議拖延數週才發現是濾波定義不同。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A white-light interferometer's height resolution equals its coherence length.","A handoff that gives Sa values without filter cut-offs or objective lets the user measure 40% different Sa on another instrument with a different L-filter."],"answer":2,"explanation":"交接時只給 Sa 數值而不附濾波截止與物鏡，使用者用另一台儀器以不同 L 濾波量到 Sa 差了 40%，雙方各自堅持儀器正確，爭議拖延數週才發現是濾波定義不同。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A handoff that gives Sa values without filter cut-offs or objective lets the user measure 40% different Sa on another instrument with a different L-filter; both sides defend their instruments and weeks pass before the filter definition is found to be the cause. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-zygo-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-bruker-3d-optical-profilers","v12o-wikipedia-csi"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
